<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Linenu la Bwina liyandikwi na Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Linenu la Bwina liyandikwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohani</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu ichi cha Linenu la Bwina chechiyandikwi na Yohani ndi chitabu chimonga pagati ya vitabu mcheche vya Lilaganu la Hinu vyevidandaula ndava ya wumi wa Yesu Kilisitu pamulima. Kila chimonga ya vitabu vyenivyo chikemelewa “Injili.” Mana yaki “Linenu la Bwina.” Vitabu vyenivyo vya Linenu la Bwina viyandikwi na Matei na Maluko na Luka na Yohani peamali kufwa Yesu. Chitabu ichi cha Linenu la Bwina yihotoleka chiyandikwi na mtumi Yohani mu mwaka wa 90 peamali kuvelekewa Kilisitu. Pamonga chitabu chilangisa lepi kuvya Yohani ndi mweayandiki, nambu chiwanangana neju muuyandika waki wa balua ya kutumbula ya Yohani na Yohani wa pili na Yohani wa datu ya Yohani. Vayandika vangi va kadeni vijova mu lukumbi lwa kuyandika balua iyo yihotoleka Yohani avi mukutama pamuji wa Efeso, ndava yeniyo yijovekana chitabu chenichi chayandikwi pamuji uwo wa Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohani idandaula hotohoto chechimkitili ayandika chitabu ichi, ndi kuvatangatila vandu vasadika kuvya Yesu ndi Kilisitu Msangula mweahaguliwi na Chapanga, ndi Mwana wa Chapanga mweavi mumi (musula ya 20:31). Mukusadika lijambu lenili tipokela wumi muliina laki. Chitabu ichi chayandikwi ndava chisomiwa na Vayawudi na vandu vangali Vayawudi. Yiwonekana kuvya muchitabu ichi chechiyandikwi na Yohani chilekengana padebe munjila ndalindali na vitabu vila vingi vidatu vya Linenu la Bwina. Yohani adandawili neju ndava ya chinamtiti yeahengili Yesu kuliku miluhumu yaki. Na hati mambu gangi gakulu gegahumalili ngati ubatizu wa Yesu na kulingiwa kwaki kulugangatu na gene gayandikwi lepi muchitabu ichi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani itumbula chitabu ichi cha Linenu la Bwina (musula ya 1:1-18).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi iyandika ndava ya chinamtiti ndalindali yeahengili Yesu (musula ya 1:19-12:50).</para>
  <para style="io">Mewa Yohani idandaula mambu gegahumili lukumbi Yesu peatamili pamulima apa gegalongwisi mbaka kufwa na kuyuka kwaki (musula ya 13:1-20:3).</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani imalakisila chitabu ichi (musula ya 21). Idandaula lukumbi Yesu peavahumili vandu lukumbi peamali kuyuka na mewa idandaula chechimkitili kuyandika chitabu chenichi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Linenu likavya mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Penapo pakutumbula, kwakona vindu vyoha viwumbiki lepi avili mmonga mweakemeliwi Linenu. Linenu avili na Chapanga. Mwene avili Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kuhuma kutumbula avili pamonga na Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kupitila mwene, Chapanga awumbili vindu vyoha, kawaka chindu hati chimonga chechawumbiki changali mwene. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mwene ndi chinyepa cha wumi na wumi wene uletili lumuli kwa vandu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Lumuli lwenulo lulangasa kuchitita, na chene chitita chihotola lepi kulujimisa.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Chapanga amtumili mundu mmonga liina laki Yohani, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />mwene abweli kuvajovela vandu kuluvala lumuli lwenulo. Abweli muni vandu voha vayuwana na kusadika ujumbi waki. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohani mwene avi lepi lumuli lwenulo, nambu abweli kuvajovela vandu kuluvala lumuli lwenulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Lwenulo ndi lumuli lwa chakaka, lumuli lwelubwela pamulima na kuvalangasila vandu voha.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Hinu, linenu lila avili pamulima na kupitila mwene Chapanga awumbili mulima, nambu vandu va pamulima wammanyili lepi. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Abwelili pavandu vaki mwene, nambu vandu vaki vampokili lepi. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Nambu vandu vevampokili, na kumsadika, avapeli uhotola wa kuvya vana va Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Vavi vana va Chapanga lepi kwa kuvelekewa ngati vandu chevivelekewa. Amala vavelikwi lepi ngati vandu chevigana, nambu kwa maganu ga Chapanga mwene.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Linenu lila akavya mundu, akatama kwitu. Ndi tiuwene ukulu waki, ukulu waki mwene nga Mwana wa Dadi Chapanga, amemili ubwina wa Chapanga na uchakaka.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohani avajovili vandu malovi gaki. Akajova kwa lwami, “Mwenuyu ndi yula mwenamuluwili penajovili, ‘Ibwela mundu mweigelekela pahali pangu mkulu kuliku nene, muni amali kuvya kwakona nene kuvelekewa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ndava cheavili ubwina waki wamahele tete tavoha tipokili mota yamahele. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Chapanga atipeli malagizu kupitila Musa, nambu ubwina wa Chapanga na chakaka utibwelili kupitila Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Kawaka mundu mweamuwene Chapanga katu. Nambu nga Mwana waki yuyo mweavi Chapanga na mweaganiwi na Dadi, mwene atimanyisi mambu gaki.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa Yohani Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matei 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Genaga ndi malovi Yohani geajovili ndava yaki lukumbi vachilongosi va Vayawudi ku Yelusalemu pevavatumili vamteta va Chapanga na Valawi vamkotayi, “Veve wayani?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohani abelili lepi kuyangula likotesi lenilo, nambu akajova hotohoto, “Nene lepi Kilisitu Msangula.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Kangi vakamkota, “Hinu veve ndi wayani? Wu, veve ndi Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohani akayangula, “Lepi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Vakamkota kangi, “Veve ndi yula mlota wa Chapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Akavayangula, “Lepi!”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Kangi vakamkota, “Hinu wayani veve? Wijova wuli kukuvala wamwene? Utijovelayi na tete tikavayangula vevatitumili.”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohani akayangula, nene ndi yula mlota Isaya ajovili malovi gaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Nene ndi lwami lwa mundu ikemela kulugangatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Mgolosayi njila ya Bambu.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Vandu avo vatumwili na Vafalisayu, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />vakamkota Yohani, “Ngati veve lepi Kilisitu Msangula mweahaguliwi na Chapanga, amala Eliya, amala mlota wa Chapanga, ndava kyani wibatiza?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohani akavayangula, “Nene nibatiza kwa manji, nambu avi mmonga pagati yinu, mwakona kummanya. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Mweibwela pahali pangu, ndi nene niganikiwa lepi hati kuwopola nyosi za champali zaki.”<figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Mundu awalili vilatu</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Mambu genago gakitiki kumuji wa Betania, kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani, Yohani kweavi mukubatiza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Mwana Limbelele wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Chilau yaki, Yohani amuwene Yesu akumbwelela akajova, “Lola, mwenuyu ndi Mwana limbelele wa Chapanga, ndi mweiwusa kumbudila Chapanga pamulima! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ndi mwenamlongalili yula penajovili, ‘Pahali pa nene ibwela mundu mkulu kuliku nene, mwene avili kwakona nene kuvelekewa!’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Hati namwene nangammanya, nambu nibweli kubatiza na manji muni vandu va Isilaeli vammanyayi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Kangi Yohani atijovili gala geagawene, “Namuwene Mpungu Msopi akumuhelelela ngati ngunda kuhuma kunani na kutula panani yaki. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nene nangammanya, nambu yula mweanitumili kubatiza vandu na manji amali kunijovela, ‘Mundu mweakumlola Mpungu Msopi akumuhelelela kuhuma kunani na kutama panani yaki, ndi mweibatiza na Mpungu Msopi.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Kangi Yohani akajova nene nigalolili mambu aga na nikuvajovela uchakaka kuvya mwenuyu ndi Mwana waki Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vawuliwa va kutumbula va Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Kangi chilau yaki, Yohani avili pandu penapo, pamonga na vawuliwa vaki vavili. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Peamuwene Yesu ipita akajova, “Lola! Uyu ndi Mwana Limbelele wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Vawuliwa vavili vala pevayuwini malovi geajovayi Yohani gala vakamlanda Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu ang'anamwiki, avawene vawuliwa vala vakumlanda, akavakota, “Mwilonda kyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Vakamkota, “Labi witama koki?” Labi mana yaki Muwula.<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu akavajovela, “Mbwela, na nyenye yati mwilola,” Vawuliwa vala vakamlanda yavili lukumbi lwa saa kumi ya kimihi na vakatama kwaki ligono lenilo.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andelea, mlongo waki Simoni Petili avi mmonga pagati ya vavili avo vevamyuwini Yohani geajovili, vakamlanda Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andelea akatumbula kumlonda Simoni mlongo waki, akamjovela “Timuwene Msangula.” Ndi kujova “Kilisitu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Kangi ampeliki Simoni kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Ndi Yesu akamlolokesa Simoni akajova, “Simoni veve mwana wa Yohani. Hinu yati ukemelewa Kefa,” Kwa Chigiliki ndi Petili, mana yaki “Litalau.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumkemela Filipi na Natanyeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Chilau yaki Yesu akawuka, kuhamba kumulima wa Galilaya ndi amkolili Filipi, akamjovela “Nilandayi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipi mkolonjinji wa ku Betisaida, muji wevitama Andelea na Petili. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipi amkoli Natanyeli, akamjovela, “Timuwene mwene, mweayandikiwi na Musa muchitabu cha malagizu, na vamlota va Chapanga vayandiki mambu gaki, Yesu wa kuhuma kumuji wa Nazaleti mwana wa Yosefu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanyeli akamkota Filipi, “Chindu cha bwina chihotola wuli kuhumila ku Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Mwene akamjovela, “Bwelayi ulole.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu peamuwene Natanyeli akumbwelela, akajova, “Lola! Chakaka mwenuyu ndi Mwiisilaeli chakaka, kawaka udesi mugati yaki hati padebe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanyeli akamkota Yesu, “Unimanyi wuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">“Mwene akamyangula, kwakona Filipi angakukemela nakuwene pewavi pahi pa mkongo wa mkuyu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Penapo Natanyeli akamjovela, “Muwula,” Veve ndi Mwana wa Chapanga! “Veve ndi Nkosi wa Isilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu akamjovela usadika ndava nikujovili nakuwene pahi ya mkongo wa mkuyu? Yati ukugawona gavaha neju ya aga. <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Ndi akayonjokesa kujova, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, yati mwilola kunani kwa Chapanga kudinduka na vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga vikwela na kuhelela panani pa Mwana wa Mundu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Mselebuko wa ndowa kumuji wa Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ligono la datu kwavi na mselebuko kumuji wa Kana, mulima wa Galilaya, na nyina waki Yesu avili. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu mewa agongoliwi kumselebuko pamonga na vawuliwa vaki. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Lukumbi divayi payamaliki, nyina waki akamjovela Yesu, “Divayi yimaliki!”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu akamyangula, “Ukotoka kunijovela cha kuhenga. Lukumbi lwangu lwakona kuhika.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Kangi, nyina wa Yesu akavajovela vanalihengu, “Chochoha cheakuvajovela, muhengayi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Penapo kwavili na vihulu sita ya kuvikila manji kwenuko, kila umonga weuhotola kumema madebe gavili amala gadatu ga manji. Yeyavikiwi penapo ndava ya mvelu wa Vayawudi kujinyambisa ndava ya kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu akavajovela, “Mumemesa manji muvihulu vyenivyo.” Vakagamemesa mbaka panani. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Kangi akavajovela, “Hinu mnegayi mumpelayi myimilila mselebuko, navene vakampelekela.” <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Myimilila mselebuko peagawonjili manji gala akalola gang'amwiki kuvya divayi. Mwene nakumanya kweyahumili, nambu vala vatumisi vevanegili vamanyili. Myimilila mselebuko amkemili mkolo ndowa, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />akamjovela, “Vandu voha vitendelekela hoti divayi yabwina na vandu vakanywayi neju, ndi vitendelekela yangali makakala yila, hinu veve uyivikili divayi ya bwina mbaka pamwishu!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Chenicho chavi chinamtiti cha kutumbula cheachikitili Yesu ku Kana, pamulima wa Galilaya. Akalangisa ukulu waki, vawuliwa vaki ndi vakamsadika.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Pegamaliki ago, Yesu akawuka pamonga na nyina waki, na valongo vaki na vawuliwa vaki vahambili ku Kapelanaumu kwavatamili magono gadebe.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matei 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maluko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Mselebuko wa Vayawudi wewukemelewa Pasaka wavili papipi kuhika, Yesu akahamba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Hinu avakolili vandu Paluvanja lwa nyumba ya Chapanga, vagulisayi ng'ombi mambelele na ngunda, na vabadilisa mashonga vatamili mumeza zavi.<figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Vabadilisa mashonga</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Ndi akabota mchapilu wa nyosi akavavinga voha kuvala ya Nyumba ya Chapanga vene pamonga na ng'ombi na mambelele gavi, kangi akapechengana mashonga gavi akazibilindusa meza zavi. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Akavajovela vevagulisa ngunda vala, “Muwusa vindu vyenivi. Mkotokayi kukita nyumba ya Dadi wangu kuvya pandu pa kugulisa na kugula vindu!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Vawuliwa vaki vakumbwiki kuvya Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova “Mwe! Chapanga uganu wangu kwa nyumba yaku ukunitinyisa mugati yangu ngati motu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Vayawudi vangi vakamkota Yesu, “Wu, ulangisu woki yati wikita kulangisa una uhotola wa kukita genago?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu akavayangula, “Mgwisa Nyumba Chapanga iyi, na nene yati nijenga kangi mu magono gadatu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Penapo Vayawudi vamkotili, “Wihotola wuli kujenga mu magono gadatu? Ndava nyumba ya Chapanga iyi yijengiwi mulukumbi lwa miyaka alobaini na sita!”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Nambu Nyumba ya Chapanga Yesu yeailongelelayi ndi higa yaki. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Hinu, peayukisiwi, vawuliwa vaki vakumbwiki kuvya ajovili ago, vakagasadika Mayandiku Gamsopi na malovi Yesu geavajovili.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyimanya mitima ya vandu voha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu peavi ku Yelusalemu kumselebuko wa Pasaka, vandu vamahele vamsadiki pavauwene ulangisu weavakitili. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Nambu Yesu avasadiki lepi vandu avo muni avamanyili voha. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Aganili lepi kujovewa chochoha ndava ya vandu, muni mwene agamanyili bwina mambu gegavi mumitima yavi.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kwavi na chilongosi mmonga Myawudi wa chikundi cha Vafalisayu, liina laki Nikodemu. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Ligono limonga kimihi Nikodemu amhambalili Yesu akamjovela, “Muwula, tikumanyii ngati veve muwula mweutumwili kuhuma kwa Chapanga, muni kawaka mundu mweihotola kukita ulangisu weukita changali kuvya na Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu akamjovela, “Chakaka nikujovela, mundu ngati avelekiwi lepi kavili ihotola lepi kulola Unkosi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemu akamkota, “Wu, mundu mvaha yihotoleka kuvelekewa kavili? Yihotoleka lepi kuyingila mulutumbu lwa nyina waki na kuvelekewa kavili.”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu akamyangula, “Chakaka nikukujovela,” Mundu ngati avelekiwi lepi kwa manji na kwa Mpungu Msopi katu nakuhotola kuyingila mu Unkosi wa Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Mundu ivelekewa chihiga kwa dadi na mau, nambu ivelekewa chimpungu kwa Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ukotoka kukangacha kuvya nijovili yikumgana mundu kuvelekewa kavili. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Chimbungululu chibuma, kuhamba kwechigana wiyuwana chibuma, nambu wimanya lepi kwe chihuma amala kwe chihamba. Mewawa kwa kila mundu mweavelekiwi kwa Mpungu Msopi.<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemu akamkota, “Mambu genaga gihotoleka wuli?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu akamyangula, “Veve muwula wa vandu va Isilaeli nakugamanya mambu aga? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Chakaka nikujovela, tete tijova getikugamanya na tikuvajovela vandu vindu vyetiviwene, nambu nyenye nakuyidakila ujumbi witu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Nivajovili mambu ga pamulima nakusadika, hinu mwihotola wuli kusadika nikavajovela mambu ga kunani kwa Chapanga? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kawaka mundu mwahambili kunani kwa Chapanga, nambu Mwana wa Mundu ndi mweahelili kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Ngati Musa cheanyakwili Liyoka la Shaba panani ya ndonga kulugangatu kula, mewa na Mwana wa Mundu yati inyakuliwa kunani, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />muni kila mundu mweakumsadika yati ivya na wumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Muni Chapanga avaganili neju vandu va mulima hati amuwusili Mwana waki ngamwene yuyo, muni yoyoha mwaisadika akotoka kuyaga ndi avyayi na wumi wa magono goha. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Chapanga amtumili lepi Mwana waki pamulima ndava ya kuvahamula vandu, nambu kuvasangula.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Mweakumsadika Mwana ihamuliwa lepi, nambu mwangamsadika amali kuhamuliwa, ndava amsadiki lepi, nga Mwana yuyo wa Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Na uhamula wene ndi uwu, lumuli lubwelili pamulima nambu vandu vaganili chitita kuliku lumuli, muni matendu gavi gahakau. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Mundu yoyoha mweikita gahakau angalugana lumuli, mewa ibwela lepi kulumuli, muni igana lepi matendu gaki gahakau galangalayi. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Nambu mundu yeyoha mweilanda gachakaka ibwela kulumuli muni matendu gaki galolekanayi, gahengiki kwa kumyidakila Chapanga.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohani Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Pegamaliki genago, Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vakahamba kumulima wa Yudea, akatama navu kwenuko na kubatiza vandu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Mewawa Yohani avi mukubatiza vandu ku Ainoni, papipi na ku Salemu, muni kwenuko kwavi na manji gamahele vandu vamhambalili, mwene akavabatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Genaga gahumalili lukumbi Yohani peavi angasopewa muchifungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Ukahumila muhutanu pagati ya vawuliwa va Yohani na myawudi mmonga ndava ya mvelu wa kunyambiswa ndava ya kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Hinu, vawuliwa avo vakamhambila Yohani na kumjovela “Muwula mundu yula mwewavili nayu kumwambu ya Yoludani, yula veve mwewatijovili malovi gaki, hinu namwene ibatiza na vandu voha vakumlanda!”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohani akavayangula, “Mundu ihotola lepi kuvya na chindu ngati angapewa na Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Nyenye mwavene mumanyili kuvya najovili, ‘Nene lepi Kilisitu Msangula, nambu natumiwi nimlongolela.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mdala wa ndowa ndi waki mkolo ndowa, nambu nkozi wa mkolo ndowa mweiyima kumyuwanila iheka neju kuyuwana mkolo ndowa ijova. Mewa nene nisangalwiki neju. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yesu yikumgana avyayi mkulu na nene nivyayi namdebe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mweibwela kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Mweibwela kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga ndi mkulu kuliku voha, mweihuma pamulima ndi wa pamulima, na ilongela mambu ga pamulima. Nambu mweibwela kuhuma kunani ndi ilongosa vindu vyoha. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Mwene ijova gala geagawene na kuyuwana, nambu kawaka mundu mweiyidakila ujumbi waki. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Nambu mundu yoyoha mweiyidakila ujumbi waki ndi ijova Chapanga ndi mchakaka. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ndava yula mweatumwili na Chapanga ijova malovi ga Chapanga, ndava Chapanga ammemisi mundu mwenuyo Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Dadi amganili Mwana na amgotolili vindu vyoha. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Mweakumsadika Mwana avi na wumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu, nambu angamsadika Mwana avi lepi na wumi, nambu ligoga la Chapanga likumtamila.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Mdala Msamaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Vafalisayu vayuwini kuvya Yesu avi mukupata vawuliwa vamahele na kuvabatiza kuliku Yohani. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ndi chakaka kuvya Yesu mwene abatiza lepi, nambu vawuliwa vaki ndi vevabatizayi vandu. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Hinu Yesu peagayuwini genago, akawuka ku Yudea na kuwuya ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Mulugendu lwenulo yamganili kuvedukila kumulima wa Samaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ndi peahikili muji umonga pamulima wa Samaliya weukemiwa Sikali, papipi na mgunda wa Yakobo weampelilli mwana waki, mweikemiwa Yosefu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Pandu penapo pavi na chiliva cha Yakobo, na Yesu ndava ya kutotokela na lugendu, akatama pamuhana ya chiliva. Yavili ngati lukumbi lwa muhi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Kangi, akabwela mdala mmonga mkolonjinji wa ku Samaliya kunega manji. Yesu akamjovela, “Nipelayi manji ninywayi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Lukumbi lwenulo vawuliwa vaki vahambili kumuji kugula chakulya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Nambu mdala yula akamjovela, “Veve wa Myawudi, na nene namdala msamaliya! Uhotola wuli kuniyupa manji?” Muni Vayawudi na Vasamaliya katu vitama lepi pamonga.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu akamyangula, “Ngati kuvya umanyayi chindu chechiwusiwa na Chapanga ndi yani mweakukujovela, ‘nipelayi manji ninywai,’ Ngawamali, kumuyupa manji gegileta wumi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mdala yula akamjovela, “Bambu, veve wangali ndeve ya kunegela manji, na chiliva chinyoliki. Ugapata koki manji gegavi na wumi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Wu, veve ukujikita wa mkulu kuliku dadi witu Yakobo? Mwene ndi mweatipelili chiliva ichi, mwene na vana vaki pamonga na mifuya yaki vanywayi manji ga chiliva ichi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu akamyangula, “Yoyoha mweinywa manji aga yati ivya na njota kavili. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Nambu yoyoha mweinywa manji gala genikumpela nene, katu ivya lepi na njota magono goha. Manji genikumpela givya mugati yaki ngati chinyepa cha manji ga wumi na kumpela wumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mdala mwenuyo akamjovela, “Bambu, unipela manji genago muni nikotoka kuvya na njota kavili na nikotoka kubwela penapa kunega manji.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu akamjovela, “Uhamba ukamkemela mngwana waku, ubwela nayu penapa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mdala yula akayangula, “Nene nangali mgosi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu akamjovela “Uyangwili chakaka, wangali mgosi. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Muni wavi na vagosi mhanu, na mgosi mweutama nayu hinu mgosi waku lepi. Penapo ujovili chakaka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mdala yula akamjovela, “Bambu, niwona kuvya veve wa mlota wa Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Vagogo vitu vamufugamila Chapanga kuchitumbi ichi, nambu nyenye mwijova kuvya pandu pa kumuyupila Chapanga ndi ku Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu akamjovela “Unisadika chenijova lwalabwela lukumbi nakumfugamila Dadi, panani ya chitumbi amala ku Yelusalemu kula. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Nyenye Vasamaliya mukumfugamila yula mwangammanya, nambu tete tikumfugamila yula mwetimumanyili, ndava muni usangula wihuma kwa Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Nambu lukumbi lubwela, kangi lumali kubwela ndi vala vandu vevakumfugamila kwa uchakaka, yati vamfugamila Dadi mukulongoswa na Mpungu Msopi na chakaka. Muni dadi akuvagana vandu vamfugamila chenicho. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Chapanga ndi Mpungu na vandu vevamfugamila yikuvagana vamfugamila Dadi mukulongoswa na Mpungu Msopi na kuumanya uchakaka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mdala yula akamjovela, “Nimanyili kuvya Msangula mweikemiwa Kilisitu ibwela. Peibwela yati akutimanyisa tete kila chindu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu akamjovela, “Nene mwenilongela na veve ndi mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Bahapo vawuliwa vaki vakawuya, na kukangasa neju pavamuweni ilongela na mdala. Nambu kawaka mundu mweajovili, “Ugana kyani?” Amala, “Ndava kyani wilongela na mdala?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Hinu, mdala yula akachileka chihulu chaki palapala na kuhamba kumuji na kuvajovela vandu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Mbwela mukamlola mundu mweanijovili mambu goha genikitili! Wu, yihotoleka kuvya ndi Kilisitu Msangula?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Vandu vakawuka kumuji na kumuhambila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Lukumbi lwenulo vawuliwa vaki vamyupili neju Yesu, “Muwula, ulyayi chakulya.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Nene nivii nachu chakulya chemwangachimanya nyenye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Vawuliwa vaki vakakotana vene kwa vene, “Wu, avi mundu mweamletili chakulya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu akavajovela, “Chakulya changu ndi kuhenga geigana yula mweanitumili na kumalakisa lihengu laki. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Nyenye mwijova, ‘Yakona miheyi mcheche ndu na lukumbi lwa kubena yati lubwela!’ Nambu nene nikuvajovela, myinula mihu ginu mlola migunda, mabenu gakangili giganikiwa kubenwa! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Yula mweibena ipokela luhuna lweluganikiwa kupewa kwa lihengu laki, na kuyola mabenu ndava ya wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu, muni mweimija na mbenaji vihekelela pamonga. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Vandu pevijova kuvya ‘Mundu mmonga imija na mundu yungi ibena, luhumu ulu ndi chakaka.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Nene navatumili nyenye mkabena changali lihengu, vangi vahengili lihengu, nambu nyenye mupatili utangatila ndava ya lihengu lavi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Vasamaliya vamahele pachijiji chila vamsadiki Yesu ndava ya malovi geajovili mau yula, “Anijovili mambu goha genihengili.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Vasamaliya vamhambili Yesu vakamuyupa neju atama navu, namwene akatama navu magono gavili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Vandu vamahele, vamsadiki Yesu ndava ya malovi gaki. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Vakamjovela mdala yula, “Tete tisadika, nambu lepi ndava ya malovi gaku, muni tavete tiyuwini na timanyili kuvya mwenuyu ndi chakaka Msangula wa vandu va pamulima.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mwana wa mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Pagamaliki magono gavili, Yesu akawuka penapo, akahamba ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Muni Yesu mwene ajovili hotohoto kuvya, “Mlota wa Chapanga nakuyidakiliwa pamulima waki.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Hinu peahikili ku Galilaya, Vagalilaya vamahele vampokili. Ndava vagawene goha geahengili ku Yelusalemu, muni navene vavi kukoko kumselebuko wa Pasaka.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Kangi Yesu ahikili kavili ku Kana, kumuji wa Galilaya, pandu peang'anamwisi manji kuvya divayi. Kwenuko kwavi na chilongosi mmonga wa chinkosi mweavi na mwana waki mtamu ku Kapelanaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Chilongosi yula peayuwini kuvya Yesu ahumili ku Yudea na kuhika ku Galilaya, akamhambila na kumuyupa ahamba akamlamisa mwana waki mweavi mulung'olelu. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu akamjovela, “Nyenye changalola ulangisu na gachinamtiti katu mwisadika lepi!”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Yula chilongosi akamjovela, “Bambu, chondi tihamba kwakona mwana vangu kufwa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu akamjovela, “Uhambayi, mwana waku yati ilama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Mundu yula akasadika malovi ga Yesu, akahamba. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Peavi akona munjila akakonganeka na vatumisi vaki, vakamjovela kuvya mwana waku alamili!<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Mwene akavakota lukumbi msongolo pealamili, vene vakamyangula, “Golo saa saba ya muhi, utamu wamuhumili.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Dadi yula akamanya kuvya lwavi lukumbi lulolo, Yesu peamjovili “Mwana waku yati ilama.” Penapo mwene pamonga na valongo vaki vakamsadika Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Wenuwu wavi ulangisu wa kukangasa weahengili Yesu peawukili ku Yudea kuhamba ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu palitanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Pegamaliki genago, Yesu ahambili ku Yelusalemu kumselebuko wungi wa Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Kula ku Yelusalemu, papipi na mlyangu uvaha wa mambelele, kwavi na litanda lelikemelewa kwa Chiebulania Betizata, lelavi na mabanji mhanu gajengiwi kulitindila. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mu mabanji genago kwavi na vatamu vamahele vatamili, vangalola na vevagogodili higa na vevapoli higa. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Valindilayi manji gatimbuganayi, muni luvi lukumbi, mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga ihelela na kuyingila mulitanda na kugatimbugana manji. Mundu mweatumbwili kuyingila mumanji pegamali kutimbugana, ndi alamili utamu wowoha wula weavi nawu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Musitali wenuwu wipatika lepi mu mayandiku gangi ga kadeni</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Penapo pavi na mundu mmonga mweapoli higa kwa miyaka selasini na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu peamuwene mundu yula agonili na kuni imanya kuvya ilwala kwa magono gamahele, akamkota “Wu, ugana kulama?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Mwene akamyangula, “Bambu, nene nangali mundu wa kuniyingisa mulitanda lukumbi manji pegitimbuliwa. Penilinga kuyingila ndi mundu yungi akunilongolela.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu akamjovela, “Yimuka, tola lusongwani lwaku ugenda.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Bahapo mundu yula akalama, akatola mpasa waki na kugenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Lijambu lenili lakitiki pa Ligono la Kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Hinu vachilongosi va Vayawudi vakamjovela mundu yula mwealamili, “Lelu ndi Ligono la Kupumulila, malagizu gibesa veve kugega mpasa waku.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Nambu mwene akavayangula, “Mundu mweanilamisi ndi mweanijovili tola mpasa waku, ugendayi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Vene vakamkota, “Wu, mundu mwenuyo mweakujovili, utola lusongwani lwaku ugendayi, ndi yani?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Nambu mundu yula mwealamiswi nakummanya Yesu kuvya ndi yani, muni Yesu amali kuwuka na kwavi na vandu vamahele vavi penapo.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ndi mwanakandahi Yesu akamkolela mundu yula Munyumba ya Chapanga, akamjovela “Hinu, ulamili ukotoka kukita gahakau kavili, likoto kukukamula lijambu lihakau neju.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Mundu yula akawuka na kuhamba kuvajovela vachilongosi va Vayawudi kuvya, yula mweamlamisi ndi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ndava muni Vayawudi vakatumbula kumung'aha Yesu ndava akitili lijambu lenilo Ligono la Kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu akavayangula, “Dadi wangu ihenga lihengu kila ligono na nene niganikiwa nihenga lihengu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ndava ya malovi genago, vachilongosi va Vayawudi vayonjokisi kulonda mpangu wa kumkoma Yesu lepi ndava ya kudenya Malagizu ga Ligono la Kupumulila ndu, nambu mewa ndava ya kujova Chapanga ndi Dadi waki, muni ajovili mwene na Chapanga vamonga.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhotola wa Mwana wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu akavajovela, chakaka nikuvajovela, Mwana nakuhotola kukita chindu chochoha mwene, ihotola kukita chila cheachiwene kuvya Dadi waki ikita. Muni chila cheachikita Dadi na Mwana achikita chichocho. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Dadi akumgana Mwana, ndi akumlangisa kila chindu cheikita mwene, kangi yati amlangisa mambu gakulu kuliku aga na nyenye yati mwikangasa. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ngati cheakuvayusa vevafwili na kuvapela wumi, mewawa Mwana akuvapela wumi vala veakuvagana. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Dadi akumhamula lepi mundu yoyoha, lihengu loha la kuhamula vandu amgotolili Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Muni vandu voha vamtopesa Mwana ngati chevakumtopesa Dadi. Angamtopesa Mwana akumtopesa lepi Dadi mweamtumili.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, mweakugayuwana malovi gangu na kumsadika yula mweanitumili yati ivya na wumi wa magono goha. Katu ihamuliwa lepi, ndi amali kukupuka mulifwa na kuyingila muwumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Chakaka nikuvajovela lukumbi lubwela, ndi lumali kubwela vevafwili yati vakugayuwana malovi ga Mwana wa Chapanga, vene vevakugayuwana, yati vivya na wumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Muni ngati mewa Dadi cheavili kutumbula kwa wumi. Mewawa ampeli mwana kuvya mtumbula wa wumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Kangi ampeli uhotola wa kuhamula ndava mwene ndi Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mkoto kukangaswa kuyuwana malovi aga, muni lukumbi lubwela ndava ya vandu voha vevafwili yati viyuwana malovi gaki, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />vene yati viyuka, vevahengili gabwina yati viyuka na kuvya na wumi. Na vala vevahengili matendu gahakau yati viyuka na kuhamuliwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akujilongalela mwene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Nene nakuhotola kukita chindu kwa uhotola wangu namwene. Nene nihamula ngati cheniyuwana kuhuma kwa Dadi, na uhamula wangu ndi wa chakaka. Maganu gangu lepi kukita chenigana nanwene nambu cheigana yula mweanitumili.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Ngati nijova mambu gangu namwene, malovi gangu gihotola lepi kuyidakiliwa kuvya ga chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Nambu avi yungi mweijova ndava ya nene, na nene nimanyili kuvya goha geijova ndava yangu ndi gachakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Nyenye mwatumili ujumbi kwa Yohani Mbatizaji mwene ajovili gachakaka ndava ya nene. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Nene nihuvalila lepi vandu vangi vajova ndava yangu, nambu nijova mambu genago muni nyenye msanguliwayi. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohani avili ngati hahi yeyiyaka na kulangasa, na nyenye mwahagwili kusangalukila lumuli lwenulo mulukumbi luhupi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Nambu malovi gevijova vandu ndava yangu ndi gakulu neju kuliku gala gevijova kumvala Yohani. Muni malovi genikugahenga ndi anipelili Dadi nimala kuhenga, ndi gilangisa hotohoto kuvya Dadi ndi mweanitumili. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Dadi mweanitumili mewawa ijova ndava yangu. Nyenye katu nakuyuwana Chapanga kwa makutu ginu amala kupalola pamihu paki, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />ujumbi waki wangatama, mumitima yinu ndava mukumsadika lepi yula mweamtumili. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Nyenye mukugalola neju Mayandiku Gamsopi mwihololela kuvya mugati yaki mwipata wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu, na kumbi mayandiku gagago gijova ndava yangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Nambu nyenye mwibela kubwela kwangu muni mupokela wumi wa magono goha.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Nene nilonda lepi kulumbiwa na vandu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Nambu nivamanyili nyenye, nimanyili kuvya uganu wa Chapanga uvili lepi mumitima hinu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nene nibweli ndava ya uhotola wa Dadi wangu, nambu munipokili lepi, nambu mundu yungi akabwelayi kwa uhotola waki mwene yati mukumpokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Muhotola wuli, kusadika kuni nyenye mwigana kulumbilana nyenye mwavene nambu mukuulonda lepi ukulu kuhuma kwa mwene mweavi Chapanga? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Mkotoka kuholalela kuvya nene nikuvatakila kwa Dadi. Musa mwemukumuhuvalila ndi mweakuvatakila. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ngati chakaka kuvya mukumusadiki Musa, ngamunisadiki na nene mewawa, muni Musa ayandiki malovi gegakunivala nene. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Nambu yikavyayi mwisadika lepi gala geagayandiki, muhotola wuli, kusadika genijova?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvapela chakulya vandu elufu mhanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matei 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Pegamaliki genago, Yesu akakupuka Nyanja Galilaya yikemelewa mewa Nyanja Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Msambi uvaha wa vandu wamlandili Yesu, ndava vayiwene milangisu ya chinamtiti yeavakitili kuvalamisa vatamu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu akakwela kuchitumbi, akatama kwenuko pamonga na vawuliwa vaki. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Lukumbi lwa mselebuko wa Vayawudi wewikemelewa Pasaka wavili papipi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Hinu, Yesu pealolokisi auwene msambi uvaha wa vandu ukumbwelela ndi akamjovela Filipi, “Wu, tikagula koki mabumunda muni vandu ava valyayi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Ajovili genago kwa kumlinga Filipi, mwene amali kumanya chakuhenga.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipi akamyangula “Mabumunda ga kugula kwa hipandi miya zivili ya madini ga feza gikola lepi kwa vandu ava hati ngati kila mmonga akapewayi chipandi chidebe ndu!”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mmonga wa vawuliwa vaki liina laki Andelea, mlongo waki Simoni Petili akamjovela. <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Penapa avi msongolo mmonga ana mabumunda mhanu ga shayili na somba zivili, nambu zikola kiki kwa vandu vamahele ngati ava?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu akajova “Muvatamika vandu.” Pandu penapo pavi na manyahi gamahele. Hinu, vandu vakatama na jumula vavi vagosi ndu vandu elufu mhanu. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu akatola mabumunda gala na kumsengusa Chapanga, akalagiza vavagavanisila vandu vevatamili, akakita mewawa na somba zila, kila mundu apewili cheaganili. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Vandu pavayukwiti Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Vakanonga hipandi yehisigalili vikoto kuyaga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Hinu, vakayola hipandi ya mabumunda ga shayili yeyasigalili vandu pevamali kulya, ndi vakamemesa madengu kumi na gavili.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Vandu pavauwene ulangisu wenuwo weahengili Yesu, vakajova “Chakaka mwenuyu ndi mlota mwealongaliwi kuvya ibwela pamulima!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Kangi Yesu amanyili kuvya vandu vaganili kumkamula na kumvika avyai nkosi, akajibagula navu, akahamba mwene kuchitumbi.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu igenda panani ya manji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matei 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Hati peyahikili kimihi vawuliwa va Yesu vakahelela mbaka kunyanja. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Vakayingila muwatu muni vakupuka kuhamba ku Kapelanaumu. Chitita chamali kuhika, na Yesu avi akona kuvahikila. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Chimbungululu chivaha chabumai ndi Nyanja yikatumbula kutimbugana. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Vawuliwa vaki vamali kugenda muutali wa kilomita mhanu amala sita, vamuwene Yesu igenda panani ya manji, ihegelela muwatu, vayogwipi neju. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Yesu akavajovela, “Ndi nene, mkotoka kuyogopa!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Hinu, vene kwa luheku vakamtola Yesu muwatu, na bahapo watu wula ukahika pandumba pandu pevahambayi.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu vakumlonda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Chilau yaki msambi wa vandu vevasigalili mwambu ya nyanja vamanyili kuvya kwavi na watu umonga pala. Na vamanyili kuvya Yesu ayingili lepi muwatu pamonga na vawuliwa vaki, muni vawuliwa vaki vahambili vene. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Watu zingi kuhuma ku Tibelia zabweli papipi na pandu pala msambi wa vandu pevalili mabumunda, Bambu peamali kumsengusa Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Hinu, vandu vala pevamanyili kuvya Yesu pamonga na vawuliwa vaki vangavya pandu penapo, vakayingila muwatu, kuhamba ku Kapelanaumu kumlonda.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi chakulya chechileta wumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Pevamkolili Yesu mwambu ya nyanja vakamkota, “Muwula, wabweli ndali penapa?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu akavayangula, “Chakaka nikuvajovela nyenye mukunilonda lepi ndava mwauwene ulangisu wa kukangasa, nambu ndava muni mwalili mabumunda gala na kuyukuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mkoto kuchihengela lihengu chukulya chechilula, nambu mchihengela chakulya changalula ndava ya wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu. Mwana wa Mundu mwahaguliwi na kuyidakiliwa na Dadi yati akuvapela chakulya chenicho.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Vene vakamkota, “Tikita wuli muni tihotola kuhenga mahengu geigana Chapanga?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu akavayangula, “Lenili ndi lihengu leigana Chapanga muhengayi, kumsadika yula mweamtumili.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Penapo vakamkota, “Wu, yati wikita ulangisu woki wa kukangasa muni tiulola tihotola kukusadika? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Vagogo vitu valili mana kula kulugangatu, ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi. ‘Avapelili mabumunda kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga muni valyayi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu akavajovela, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, lepi Musa mweavapeli libumunda kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, ndi Dadi wangu mweavapelili nyenye libumunda la chakaka kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Muni libumunda la Chapanga ndi yula mweihelela kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga na kuvapela wumi vandu va mulima.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Vakamjovela, “Bambu, kila ligono utipelayi libumunda lenilo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu akavajovela, “Nene ndi chakulya chechileta wumi. Mweibwela kwa nene njala yikumvina lepi, mweakunisadika katu iyuwana lepi njota. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Nambu navajovili kuvya yati mukunilola nambu mukunisadika lepi. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Voha veakunipela Dadi yati vibwela kwa nene, na nene katu nakumtaga kuvala yeyoha mweibwela kwa nene. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Nihelili kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, lepi kwa kuhenga genigana namwene nambu kuhenga gegiganikiwa na yula mweanitumili. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Maganu ga yula mweanitumili ndi aga, nikotoka kumyagisa hati mmonga wa vala veanipelili nambu nivayukisa voha pa ligono la mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Muni cheigana Dadi wangu ndi chenichi, yoyoha mweakumlola Mwana na kumsadika avyayi na wumi wa magono goha, na nene yati nikumuyukisa ligono la mwishu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Vayawudi vakatumbula kung'ung'uta muni ajovili, “Nene ndi libumunda lelihelili kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Vakajova, “Mwenuyu lepi Yesu, mwana wa Yosefu? Tivamanyili dadi na nyina waki! Hinu ihotola wuli kujova kuvya ahelili kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu akavayangula, “Mkotoka kung'ung'uta mwavene. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kawaka mundu mweihotola kubwela kwa nene, ngati Dadi mweanitumili amhutili lepi kwa nene, na nene yati nikumuyukisa mundu mwenuyo ligono la mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Vamlota va Chapanga vayandiki, ‘Vandu voha yati viwuliwa na Chapanga.’ Kila mundu mweakumyuwana Dadi na kujiwula kuhuma kwaki, ibwela kwa nene. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Chenijova ndi ichi avi lepi mundu mweamuwene Dadi, nga yula mweahumili kwa Chapanga, mwenuyo ndi mweamuwene Dadi. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Chakaka, nikuvajovela mweisadika avi na wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nene ndi chakulya chechileta wumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Vagogo vinu valili chakulya chechikemiwa mana kulugangatu, nambu vafwili. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Nambu chenichi ndi chakulya chechihelili kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga muni mweilya ifwa lepi. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nene ndi chakulya cha wumi chechihelili kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga. Mundu yeyoha akalyayi libumunda lenili ilama magono goha gangali mwishu. Na libumunda lenikumpela ndi higa yangu yenikuyiwusa ndava ya wumi wa vandu va mulima.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Vayawudi vakatumbula kujovesana vene kwa vene, “Mwe, mundu uyu ihotola wuli kutipela tete higa yaki tilyayi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu akavajovela, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, mweangalya higa ya Mwana wa Mundu na kuyinywa ngasi yaki, mwivya lepi na wumi mugati yinu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Mweilya higa yangu na kunywa ngasi yangu avinawu wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu, na nene yati nikumuyukisa ligono la mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Muni higa yangu ndi chakulya cha chakaka, na ngasi yangu chindu cha kunywa cha chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Mweilya higa yangu na kunywa ngasi yangu, itama mugati yangu na nene nitama mugati yaki. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ngati Dadi cheavili mumi, anitumili nene na nene nina wumi kwa ndava yaki, mewawa mweakunilya nene yati ivya mumi ndava ya nene. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Hinu, lenili ndi libumunda leliulwiki kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, lepi ngati mana yevalili vagogo vitu, vafwili. Mweilya chakulya chenichi yati ivya na wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu ajovili genago peavili akuvawula munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi ku Kapelanaumu kula.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malovi gegileta wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Hinu, vandu vamahele vevamlandayi Yesu pavagayuwini genago, vakajova, “Aga ndi mawuliwu geginonopa! Yani mweihotola kuyuwanila?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu amanyili mumtima waki kuvya vawuliwa vaki ving'ung'uta ndava ya linenu lenilo, ndi akavajovela, “Wu, mawuliwu ago gakuvakita muleka kusadika? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Yati yivya wuli pemukumlola Mwana wa Mundu ihamba kunani kwa Chapanga kweavili hoti? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Mpungu Msopi ndi mweileta wumi, makakala ga mundu nakuhotola chindu. Malovi genikuvajovela ndi ga Mpungu Msopi na gileta wumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Pamonga na ago, nambu vavi vangi pagati yinu nakusadika.” Yesu ajovili genago ndava avamanyili kutumbula kadeni, vangasadika, na mewa yani mweakumng'anamukila. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Akayonjokesa kujova, “Ndava yeniyi navajovili kuvya kawaka mundu mweihotola kubwela kwa nene changali kutangatiliwa na Dadi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kuhumila lukumbi lwenulo vevamlandayi vamahele vakawuya mumbele, vakotoka kumlanda kavili. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu akavakota vawuliwa kumi na vavili vala, “Wu, na nyenye mwigana kuwuka?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petili akamyangula, “Bambu, tihamba kwa yani? Veve ndi uvinagu malovi gegileta wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Tete tikusadika na timanyili kuvya veve ndi wa Msopi kuhuma kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu akavajovela, “Wu, navahagwili lepi nyenye kumi na vavili? Nambu mmonga winu ndi Setani!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu ajovili genago kumvala Yuda mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti, muni mwenuyo ndi yati mweakumung'anamukila, pamonga avi mmonga pagati ya vawuliwa kumi na vavili.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na valongo vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Pegamaliki genago, Yesu agendayi ku Galilaya kwenuko. Aganili lepi kugenda pamulima wa Yudea ndava Vachilongosi va Vayawudi vaganayi kumkoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Lukumbi lwa mselebuko wa Vayawudi wewukemelewa vindanda wavi papipi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Hinu, valongo vaki vakamjovela mwene, “Uwuka penapa na uhambayi ku Yudea muni vevakulanda vagawonayi mahengu gaku geukugahenga. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Kawaka mundu mweihenga mambu cha mfiyu kuni mwene igana kumanyikana kwa vandu. Ndava wikita mambu ago, hinu jilangilasa kwa vandu va mulima woha.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Hati valongo vaki mewawa vamsadika lepi.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu akavajovela, “Lukumbi lwangu lwabwina lwakona kuhika, nambu kwa nyenye lukumbi lwoha lwabwina. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Vandu va mulima nakuhotola kuvahakalila nyenye, nambu ukunihakalila nene ndava nene nijova kuvya matendu gaki gahakau. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Nyenye mhamba kumselebuko. Nambu nene nakuhamba kumselebuko wenuwo, muni lukumbi lwangu lwabwina lwakona kuhika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Peamalili kujova genago, mwene akasigalila ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kumselebuko wa vindanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Valongo vaki pevahambili kumselebuko wa vindanda, Yesu namwene akahamba, nambu lepi hotohoto ndi chamfiyu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Vachilongosi va Vayawudi vamlondayi Yesu kumselebuko wenuwo, vakakota “Avi koki?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Pamsambi wa vandu kwavi na vandu vamahele vevajovai chinunu. Vangi pagati yavi vakajova, “Mundu mbwina.” Vangi vakajova, “Mwe! Akuvayaganisa vandu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Nambu avi lepi mundu mweahotwili kujova malovi ga Yesu hotohoto, ndava ya kuvayogopa Vachilongosi va Vayawudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Peyahikili pagati ya mselebuko, Yesu akahamba mu Nyumba ya Chapanga na kutumbula kuwula. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Hinu, Vachilongosi va Vayawudi vakakangasa na kujova, “Mundu uyu agamanyili wuli goha aga changali mwene kuwuliwa na mundu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Penapo Yesu akavayangula, “Mawuliwu genikugawula aga ganamwene lepi, nambu gaki yula mweanitumili. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mundu mweigana kuhenga gala geigana Chapanga, yati imanya ngati mawuliwu gangu gahumili kwa Chapanga amala nijova namwene. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Mweijova ga mwene ndu, mwenuyu ilonda ukulu waki mwene, nambu yula mweilonda ukulu wa mweamtumili, ndi chakaka na mugati yaki kawaka uhakau. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Wu, Musa avapelili lepi Malagizu? Nambu kawaka hati mmonga mweiyidakila Malagizu. Ndava kyani mulonda kunikoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Bahapo msambi wa vandu ukayangula, “Una mizuka veve! Yani mweigana kukukoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu akavayangula, “Nikitili ulangisu umonga na nyenye uvakangisi. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa avapeli malagizu ga kudumula jandu ndi wahumili lepi kwa Musa muni wahumili kwa vagogo. Hinu nyenye mukumdumula mundu jandu hati Ligono la Kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Yakavya mundu idumuliwa jandu Ligono la Kupumulila, ndi muni malagizu ga Musa ukoto kudenywa, hinu ndava kyani mukuniyomela ndava ya kumlamisa mundu mu Ligono la Kupumulila? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mkotoka kumuhamula mundu kwa kumlola chakuvala ndu, nambu muhamula cheyiganikiwa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Kilisitu Msangula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Vandu vangi va pa Yelusalemu vajovili, “Wu, mundu mwenuyu lepi yula vachilongosi vilonda kumkoma? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mlola, ilongela hotohoto kawaka mundu mweakumjovela hati linenu! Wu yihotoleka vachilongosi vamanyili chakaka, mwenuyu ndi Kilisitu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Nambu Kilisitu peibwela avi lepi mundu yati imanya ihumila koki. Nambu tete tikumanyi kwe ahumili mundu uyu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Hinu, Yesu peavili mukuwula Munyumba ya Chapanga akajova kwa lwami, “Mwe! Mnimanyili, hati kwe nihumili mukukumanya? Nene nibweli lepi kwa uhotola wangu. Muni mwene mweanitumili nene ndi wa chakaka, na nyenye nakummanya, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />nambu nene nimmanyili ndava nihumili kwaki, mwene ndi mweanitumili.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Hinu, vandu vakalonda kumkamula, nambu kawaka mundu mweatalambwili chiwoko kumpamisa ndava lukumbi lwaki lwavi lwakona kuhika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Vandu vamahele mu msambi wula vamsadiki, vakajova, “Peibwela Kilisitu Msangula, yati ihenga milangisu ya kukangasa yamahele neju kuliku yeihenga mundu uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manjolinjoli vitumwa kumkamula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Vafalisayu vevayuwini vandu vijova ga pahi ndava ya Yesu. Hinu, vene pamonga na Vamteta vakulu va Chapanga vavatumili valonda va nyumba ya Chapanga vamkamulayi. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu akajova, “Nakona nivii pamonga na nyenye palukumbi luhupi, kangi nihamba kwa mwene mweanitumili. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Yati mukunilonda nambu nakuniwona, na penivya nene, nyenye nakuhotola kuhika.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Vachilongosi va Vayawudi vakajovesana vene kwa vene, “Mundu mwenuyu yati ihamba koki kwe nakuhotola kumkamula? Yati ihamba kumiji ya Vagiliki, kwevahamalili vandu vitu na kuvawula Vagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Mwenuyu ijova kyani peijova, yati mukunilonda nambu nakuniwona na pala penivya nene nyenye nakuhotola kuhika?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mifuleni ya manji gegileta wumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ligono la kumalakisa mselebuko wenuwo ndi lavi ligono likulu, Yesu akayima na kujova kwa lwami mundu mweavi na njota ndi abwela kwanene anywayi. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi, mweakunisadika nene, mifuleni ya manji yeyileta wumi yati yihelela mumtima waki. <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ajovili genago kumvala Mpungu Msopi kuvya vevakumsadika vala yati vakumpokela. Lukumbi lwenulo Mpungu Msopi avi akona kuhika, ndava Yesu avi akona kupewa ukulu na Chapanga.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpechenganu pagati ya vandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Vandu vangi mu msambi wula pevayuwini malovi ago, vakajova, “Chakaka mundu uyu ndi yula mlota wa Chapanga!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Vangi vakajova, “mwenuyu ndi Kilisitu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Nambu vangi vakajova, “Wu, yihotoleka Kilisitu kuhuma ku Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Wu, Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova wuli? Gijova Kilisitu yati ihumila mu lukolo lwa Daudi na ivelekewa ku Betelehemu, pamuji wa Daudi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Hinu, mu msambi wula mpechenganu wahumalili ndava ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Vandu vangi vaganayi kumkamula nambu avi lepi mundu mweatalambwili chiwoko chaki kumpamisa.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vachilongosi va Vayawudi vibela kumsadika Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Kangi valonda vala vakavahambila Vakulu va kuteta va Chapanga na Vafalisayu. Ndi vene vakavakota valonda, “Ndava kyani, mwangamleta Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Valonda vala vakayangula, “Avi lepi mundu mweamali kujova vindu vyeajovili mundu uyu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Vafalisayu vakavakota, “Wu, na nyenye mkongiwi mewa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Wu, mumuwene hati mmonga wa chilongosi wa vandu, amala mmonga wa Vafalisayu mweakumsadika? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Lepi, nambu msambi wenuwo vangamanya Malagizu ga Bambu geampeli Musa, vapeliwi likoto na Chapanga!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Mmonga wavi avi Nikodemu mweamuhambili Yesu magono ga mumbele. Hinu mwene akavajovela. <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Malagizu gitu gijova tikumuhamula lepi mundu changali kumuyuwanila na kumanya ahengili kyani?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Vene vakamyangula, “Wu, na veve mewa uhumili ku Galilaya? Hinu ukagasoma bwina Mayandiku Gamsopi wamwene yati wilola kuvya ku Galilaya katu nakuhuma mlota wa Chapanga!” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Penapo kila mmonga awuyili kunyumba yaki.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mdala mweakamuliwi ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Kangi Yesu akahamba ku chitumbi Mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Chilau yaki lukela pehe Yesu akahamba kavili Munyumba ya Chapanga. Vandu voha vamtindili na mwene akatama na kuvawula. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Hinu vawula va malagizu na Vafalisayu vamletili mdala mmonga mwevamkamwili ugoni vakamyimika pagati yavi. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Kangi vakamkota Yesu, “Muwula mdala uyu vamkamwili ndava ya ugoni.” <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mumalagizu gitu Musa atilagizi atovewa na maganga mbaka afwayi. Mdala ngati uyu, hinu veve wijova wuli? <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Vene vajovili malovi ago muni vamlinga. Muni vapatayi linenu la kumtakila. Nambu Yesu akagundama pahi akayandika kwa lungonji lwaki pandima.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Pevayendalili kumkota, Yesu akayinuka akavajovela, “Mundu mweangambudila Chapanga pagati yinu avyayi wa kutumbula kumtova liganga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Kangi akagundama kavili akavya mukuyandika pandima. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Pevayuwini ago, vakatumbula kuwuka mmonga mmonga, valongolili vagogo. Yesu asigalili mwene, na mdala yula ayimili palapala. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu peayinwiki ndi akamkota mau, Vandu vala vavi koki? Wu, kawaka hati mundu mmonga mweakuhamwili?<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Mau yula, akamyangula, “Bambu, kawaka hati mmonga!” Yesu akamjovela, “Nene mewa nikuhamula lepi. Uhambayi, kutumbula hinu ukotoka kumbudila Chapanga kavili.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lumuli lwa vandu va mulima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu alongili kavili na vandu, akavajovela, “Nene ndi lumuli lwa mulima. Mweakunilanda katu nakugenda muchitita, nambu ivya na lumuli lwa wumi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Hinu, Vafalisayu vakamjovela, “Veve wijova ndava yaku wamwene, malovi geujova ndava yaku, na geujova gachakaka lepi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu akavayangula, “Hati ngati nijova ndava yangu namwene malovi gangu ndi gachakaka, ndava namwene nimanyili kwenihuma na kwenihamba. Nambu nyenye mumanyi lepi kwenihumili amala kwenihamba. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nyenye mwihamula ngati vandu chevihamula, nambu nene nikumuhamula lepi mundu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Nambu ngati nihamula, kuhamula kwangu ndi kwa chakaka ndava nakuvya namwene, Dadi mweanitumili avi pamonga na nene. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Mu malagizu ginu yiyandikwi ngati vandu vavili vijova kwa kuyidakila ndava ya chindu chimonga chevachiwene chindu chenicho ndi chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Nene nijova uchakaka namwene mewawa na Dadi mweanitumili ijova uchakaka ndava yangu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Bahapo vene vakamkota, “Avi koki Dadi waku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu akavayangula, “Nyenye nakunimanya nene, amala mumanyi lepi Dadi. Ngati mnimanyili nene ngammanyili na Dadi wangu mewa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu agajovili malovi ago Munyumba ya Chapanga papipi na chijomela kuvikila luteta. Kawaka mundu mweamkamwili ndava lukumbi lwaki lwavi lwakona kuhika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwihotola lepi kuhika kwenihamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu akavajovela kavili, “Nihamba namwene ndi nyenye yati mukunilonda, nambu mwifwa mukumbudila Chapanga, kwenihamba nene, nyenye nakuhotola kuhika.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Hinu, vachilongosi va Vayawudi vakajova, ndava ya kyani ijova, kwenihamba nyenye nakuhotola kuhika, “Wu, igana kujikoma mwene?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu akavajovela, “Nyenye muhumili bahapa pahi, nambu nene nihumili kunani. Nyenye va bahapa pamulima, nene na wa mulima wenuwu lepi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ndava muni navajovili kuvya yati mwifwa mukumbudila Chapanga winu, ngati mwangasadika ‘Nene Ndi Mwene,’ Mwifwa mukumbudila Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Vene vakamkota, “Veve wayani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu akayangula, “Nene ndi mwenavajovili kutumbula kadeni! <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nivii nagu gamahele ga kujova na mewawa kuvahamula nyenye. Nambu mweanitumili yula ndi chakaka, nene nikuujovela mulima mambu gala genigayuwini kuhumila kwa mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Vene vangamanya kuvya Yesu akuvajovela malovi ga Chapanga Dadi waki. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ndi Yesu akavajovela, “Pemukumunyakula Mwana wa Mundu, penapo ndi yati mwimanya kuvya ‘Nene Ndi Mwene,’ Namwene nakuhenga chochoha ndi nijova gala ndu geaniwulili Dadi. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Mweanitumili avi pamonga na nene, mwene anilekili lepi namwene ndava nihenga magono goha gala gegakumganisa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Vandu vamahele pevamyuwini Yesu ijova genago vamsadiki.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uchakaka ukuvapela kulekekeswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu akavajovela Vayawudi vala vevamsadiki, “Ngati mukugayidakila mawuliwu gangu chakaka yati mwivya vawuliwa vangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Yati mukuumanya uchakaka na uchakaka yati ukuvapela kulekekeswa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Vene vakamyangula, “Tete chiveleku cha Ibulahimu. Hati mala yimonga, nakuvya vavanda kwa mundu yoyoha mana yaki kiki peujova, ‘Yati tilekekeswa?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu akavayangula, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, mundu yoyoha mweibuda mwenuyu ndi mvanda mweabudili. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mvanda itama lepi panyumba magono goha. Nambu mwana itama magono goha. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Hinu Mwana akavapela ulekekesu yati mulekekeswa chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nivamanyili nyenye kuvya chiveleku cha Ibulahimu. Pamonga mwilonda kunikoma ndava mukugabela mawuliwu gangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Nene nijova gala geanilangisi Dadi, nambu nyenye mkugahenga gala gemuyuwini kuhuma kwa dadi winu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Vene vakamyangula, “Dadi witu Ibulahimu.” Yesu akavajovela, “Ngati nyenye kuvya vana vaki Ibulahimu ngamuhengili ngati cheahengili Ibulahimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Nene nivajovili uchakaka weniuyuwini kuhuma kwa Chapanga. Nambu nyenye mulonda kunikoma. Ibulahimu akitili lepi genago! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Nyenye mwikita mambu galagala geakitili dadi winu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Vene vakamjovela, “Tete tavana vamakunja lepi! Tivii na Dadi witu mmonga ndi Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu akavajovela, “Ngati kuvya Chapanga ndi Dadi winu, ngamuniganili nene, muni nene nahumili kwa Chapanga na hinu nivii penapa. Nibweli lepi kwa uhotola wangu nambu wa mwene mweanitumili yula. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ndava kyani mwimanya lepi genijova aga? Ndava muni nakuyuwana ujumbi wangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Nyenye vana va dadi winu Setani na mwigana kuhenga geigana dadi winu. Mwene avi mkomaji kuhumila kadeni, mwene iyima lepi upandi wa uchakaka, ndava muni mugati yaki uchakaka uvi lepi. Kila peijova udesi ijova ngati cheavili muni mwene mdese na dadi wa vadese. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ndava nene nikuvajovela uchakaka nyenye mukunisadika lepi. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Yani pagati yinu mweihotola kunijovela nene nikumbudila Chapanga? Nene nakajovayi chakaka ndava kyani mukunisadika lepi? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Mweavi waki Chapanga iyuwana malovi gaki Chapanga. Nambu nyenye nakuyuwana ndava nyenye vandu lepi va Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mkulu kuliku Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Vayawudi vakamyangula Yesu, “Wu, tete nakujova chakaka kuvya veve wa Msamaliya na kavili uvi na mzuka?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu akayangula, “Nangali mzuka. Nene nikumtopesa Dadi wangu, nambu nyenye mukunitopesa lepi nene. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nene nikuulonda lepi ukulu wangu namwene, avi mmonga mweakunilondela ukulu wangu, mwene ndi mhamula mihalu. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Chakaka nikujovela, mundu akauyidakila ujumbi wangu yati ifwa lepi nambu ivya mumi magono goha gangali mwishu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Vayawudi vakajova, “Hinu timanyili kuvya chakaka veve uvi na mzuka! Ibulahimu afwili mewawa vamlota va Chapanga vafwili hinu veve ujova ‘Mweakuukamulila ujumbi waku katu ifwa lepi, nambu ivya mumi magono goha!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Wu, veve ukujikita mkulu kuliku dadi witu Ibulahimu mweafwili?” Mewawa na vamlota va Chapanga vafwili. Veve ukujita wayani?<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu akavayangula, “Nakujilumba namwene, ukulu wangu chindu lepi. Dadi wangu mwemukumkemela Chapanga winu, mwene ndi mweakunilumba. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Nyenye mukummanya lepi, nambu nene nimanyili nikajova nangammanya, yati nivya mdese ngati nyenye, nambu nimmanyili na nikugayidakila malovi gaki. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Dadi winu Ibulahimu, ahekalili alilola ligono langu. Mwene akaliwona akavya na luheku.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Vayawudi vakamjovela, “Veve uhikisi lepi hati miyaka makumi mhanu na veve umuweni Ibulahimu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu akavajovela, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, kwakona Ibulahimu kuvelekewa nene navili.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Penapo vakanonga maganga muni vamjugumilayi nambu Yesu ajifiyili na kuwuka pa Nyumba ya Chapanga.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu mweavelekiwi ngalola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu peavili mukuhamba ndi amuwene mundu mmonga mweavingalola kuhumila kuvelekewa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Vawuliwa vaki vakamkota, “Muwula, yani mweambudili Chapanga, mundu uyu amala dadi na nyina vaki, hati avelekiwi ngalola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu akavayangula, “Mwene amala dadi na nyina waki avi lepi mweambudili Chapanga. Avelikiwi ngalola, muni makakala ga Chapanga gawonekanayi gihenga lihengu muwumi waki. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Kwakona muhi yikutigana kuhenga lihengu laki yula mweanitumili. Muni kimihi yibwela mundu nakuhotola kuhenga lihengu. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Lukumbi penivii pamulima nene ndi lumuli lwa vandu va mulima.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Peamali kujova genago, Yesu akahunya mata pahi, akakandagana ludaka na kumnyala ngalola yula mumihu. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Akamjovela, “Hamba ukajisambisa kulitanda la Siloamu.” Liina lenilo mana yaki ndi mweatumwili. Penapo, ngalola yula akahamba akajisambisa, akawuya kuni ilola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Hinu, vandu vevatama naku papipi vevammanyili kuvya avi mngangu myupaji, vakajova, “Wu, mwenuyu lepi ngalola mweatamayi na kuyupa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Vamahele vakajova, “Ena.” Vangi vakajova “Lepi, ndi iwanana naku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Nambu ngalola yula akajova, “Ndi nene mwenayupayi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Ndi vakamkota, “Wu, hinu mihu gaku uhotwili kulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Mwene akavayangula, “Mundu yula mweikemelewa Yesu akandagini ludaka, na kuninyala pamihu, akanijovela. Uhamba ukajisanja pamihu ku litanda la Siloamu. Nene nikahamba kujisanja na hinu nihotola kulola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Vakamkota, “Avi koki?” Mwene akavayangula, “Nene nimanyili lepi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vafalisayu vilonda ahotwili wuli kulama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Kangi vampeliki mundu yula mweavili hoti ngalola kwa Vafalisayu. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Ligono Yesu peakandagini ludaka na kumdindula mihu yavili Ligono la Kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Vafalisayu vakamkota kavili, “Uhotwili wuli kulola?” Mwene akavajovela, “Aninyalili ludaka pamihu, ndi nene najisambisi na hinu nilola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Vafalisayu vangi vakajova, “Mundu mwenuyu ahumili lepi kwa Chapanga, muni ikamula lepi Ligono la Kupumulila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Nambu vangi vakajova, “Ihotola wuli kuhenga gachinamtiti ngati genaga?” Pakavya na mpechenganu pagati yavi.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Vakamkota kavili, “Veve wijova wuli kumvala mwene?” “Ndava akudindwili mihu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Akavayangula, “Mwenuyo ndi mlota wa Chapanga!”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Vachilongosi va Vayawudi nakusadika ngati mundu yula avi ngalola kadeni na hinu ilola, mbaka pavavakemili dadi na nyina waki. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Vakavakota dadi na nyina waki, “Wu, mwenuyu ndi mwana winu? Ndi mwemwijova avelekiwi ngalola? Kangi ahotwili wuli kulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Vene vakayangula, “Timmanyili kuvya uyu ndi mwana witu, na avelikwi ngalola. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Nambu timanyi lepi cheahotwili kulola, mewa timmanyi lepi mweamdindwili mihu. Mumkota mwene, muni mundu mvaha ihotola kudandaula mwene.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Dadi na nyina waki vagajovili genago ndava ya kuvayogopa vachilongosi va Vayawudi muni vamali kuyidikilana kuvya mundu mweiyidakila na kujova kuvya Kilisitu ndi Msangula yati ivingiwa awuka munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ndava ya genago ndi dadi na nyina waki vajovili, “Mwene mundu mvaha ndi mumkota mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Vakamkemela kavili mundu yula mweavelikwi ngalola, vakamjovela, “Lapa palongolo ya Chapanga. Tete timanyili kuvya mundu uyu akumbudila Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Mwene akayangula, “Nene nimanyi lepi ngati akumbudila Chapanga. Nambu nimanyili chindu chimonga. Navi ngalola hinu nilola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Ndi vakamkota, “Akuhengili kyani? Akulamisi wuli mihu gaku?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Mundu yula akavayangula, “Nimali kuvajovela, nyenye mniyuwana lepi, ndava kyani mwigana kuyuwana kavili? Wu, na nyenye mewa mwigana kuvya vawuliwa vaki?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Hinu vakamuliga na kumjovela, “Veve ndi muwuliwa wa mundu yula, nambu tete tavawuliwa va Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Tete timanyili kuvya Chapanga alongili na Musa, nambu nakummanya mundu uyu ahumili koki!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Mwene akavayangula, “Chenichi ndi chindu cha kukangasa! Nyenye mwangamanya kweahumili, nambu anidindwili mihu gangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Timanyili kuvya Chapanga akuvayuwanila lepi vevakumbudila mwene, nambu akumyuwanila mundu yoyoha mweakumyogopa Chapanga na kuhenga geigana. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kutumbula mulima pewawumbiwi yiyuwaniki lepi kuvya mundu agadindwili mihu ga mundu mweavelekiwi ngalola. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ngati mundu mwenuyu nakuhuma kwa Chapanga ngaahotwili lepi kuhenga chochoha!”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Vene vakamyangula, Mwe! “Veve uvelekiwi na kukula mukumbudisa Chapanga, wihotola wuli kutiwula tete?” Hinu vakamuwusa munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ungalola wa chimpungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu ayuwini kuvya vamuwusili munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi. Hinu pevamuwene akamkota, “Wu, veve ukumsadika Mwana wa Mundu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Mundu yula akamyangula, “Mtopeswa unijovela mundu mwenuyo ndi yani, muni nimsadikayi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu akamjovela, “Umali kumuwona, mwene mweujova nayu ndi mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Mundu yula akajova, “Bambu nisadika!” Ndi akamfugamila.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu akajova, “Nene nibwelili pamulima kuvabagula vandu, muni vangalola vahotola kulola, na vevilola vavyai vangalola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Vafalisayu vangi vevavi pamonga naku vagayuwini genago, vakamkota, “Wu, na tete mewa vangalola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu akavayangula, “Ngati mwavi vangalola, ngamvalangiwi lepi mumbudili Chapanga nambu nyenye mwijova, tete tilola hinu yilangisa kuvya nyenye mbudili.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi mdimaji mbwina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu akavajovela, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, mundu yoyoha yula mweangayingila muchivaya cha mambelele kwa kupitila pamlyangu uvaha nambu iholota na kuyingila kwa pandu pangi, mwenuyo ndi muhiji na mnyagaji. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Nambu mundu yula mweiyingila kupitila mlyangu, mwenuyo ndi mdimaji wa mambelele. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mlonda wa mlyangu wa chivaya akumdindulila mlyangu mdimaji. Na mambelele giyuwana lwami lwa mdimaji, namwene akugakemela kwa mahina gavi kila limonga na kugawusa kuvala. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Akamala kugawusa kuvala, mwene akugalongolela kulongolo, na mambelele gakumlanda, ndava gakulumanya lwami lwaki. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Nambu gakumlanda lepi myehe, ndi gakumtila ndava nakulumanya lwami lwaki.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu avajovili kwa luhumu ulu, nambu vene vamanyili lepi cheaganili kuvajovela.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi mdimaji mbwina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Hinu Yesu akajova kavili, chakaka nikuvajovela nene ndi mlyangu wa chivaya cha mambelele. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Voha vevanilongolili nene, ndi vahiji na vanyagaji, na mambelele nakuvayuwanila. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nene ndi mlyangu. Mweiyingila munjila yangu yati isanguliwa, yati iyingila na kuhuma na kupewa chakulya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mhiji ibwela muni ayivayi, na kukoma na kuhalabisa. Nene nibwelili muni mupatayi wumi wa chakaka weumemili.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Nene ndi mdimaji mbwina. Mdimaji mbwina ajitendekili hati kufwa ndava ya mambelele gaki. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mhenga lihengu wa luhuna mdimaji lepi, mambelele gaki lepi. Peiwona libwa la kudahi libwela. Ileka mambelele na kutila, kangi libwa la kudahi likamula na kugapechengana. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Mundu mwenuyo itila na iyangalila lepi mambelele, ndava mwene ndi mundu wa luhuna ndu. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Nene ndi mdimaji mbwina nigamanyili mambelele gangu, na mambelele gegavi gangu ganimanyili. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Ngati Dadi cheanimanyili nene, na nene chenimmanyili Dadi. Niwusa wumi wangu hati kufwa ndava ya mambelele. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Kangi nivii na mambelele gangi ga chivaya ichi lepi. Yikunigana mewa kugaleta, na gene yati giyuwana lwami lwangu, yati kwivya na msambi umonga na mdimaji mmonga.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Dadi akunigana ndava nikuuwusa wumi wangu muni niupokelayi kavili. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kawaka mundu mweakuninyaga wumi wangu, nambu nikuuwusa kwa kugana kwangu namwene. Nivii na uhotola wa kuuwusa wumi wangu na mewa nivii na uhotola wa kuutola kavili. Chenichi ndi Dadi cheanilagizi kukita.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Ndava ya malovi genago ukahumila mpechenganu kavili pagati ya Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Vangi vamahele vakajova, “Mwenuyu ana mzuka! Mewa ana lupengu Ndava kyani kumyuwanila?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Nambu vangi vakajova, “Malovi aga lepi ga mundu ana mzuka. Wu, mzuka uhotola kudindula mihu ga vangalola?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ibelelewa na Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ku Yelusalemu kwenuko kwavili na mselebuko wa kukumbuka kuyibagula Nyumba ndava ya Bambu. Lukumbi lwenulo lwavi lwa mbepu. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu mwene avi igenda Munyumba ya Chapanga mu libanji la Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Vayawudi vamtindili, kumkota, “Ukutileka na maholo mbaka ndali? Ngati veve ndi Kilisitu Msangula, hinu utijovela hotohoto.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu akavayangula, “Nivajovili, nambu nyenye nakunisadika. Mahengu genihenga nene kwa liina la Dadi wangu gilangisa nene ndi yani. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Nambu nyenye mwisadika lepi, ndava nyenye lepi mambelele gangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Mambelele gangu giyuwana lwami lwangu. Nene nigamanyili na gene gakunilanda. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nene nikugapela wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu, katu vifwa lepi, na kawaka mundu mweihotola kuvanyaga kuhuma kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Dadi wangu ndi mkulu kuliku vyoha, na kawaka mundu wa kuhotola kuvanyaga mu mawoko ga Dadi wangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Nene na Dadi, tavamonga.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Hinu, Vayawudi vakanonga maganga muni vamkomayi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu akavajovela, “Nivalangisi mahengu gamahele kuhuma kwa Dadi. Wu, lihengu loki lelikuvakita nyenye munikoma kwa maganga?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Vayawudi vakamyangula, “Tikukoma lepi kwa maganga ndava ya mahengu gabwina gehuhengili, nambu ndava ukumliga Chapanga, veve wa mundu ndu nambu ukujikita wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu akavajovela, “Yiyandikwi mu malagizu ginu, ‘Nene nijovili, nyenye ndi vachapanga?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Chapanga avakemili vandu vala vevapewili ujumbi waki ndi vachapanga, na tete timanyili kuvya Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova chakaka magono goha. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Dadi anihagwili na kunituma pamulima. Ndava kyani nyenye mukunijovela, nikumliga Chapanga. Penijova nene Mwana wa Chapanga? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ngati nikugahenga lepi mahengu ga Dadi wangu, mkoto kunisadika. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ngati nikugahenga, hati ngati mukunisadika lepi, hinu mugasadika mahengu genago. Muhotola kumanya chakaka kuvya Dadi avi mugati yangu, na nene nivii mugati yaki.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Vakalinga kavili kumkamula Yesu nambu akavalema mu mawoko gavi.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu akahamba kangi kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani, pandu peavi Yohani ibatiza, akatama kwenuko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Vandu vamahele vambwelili Yesu na kujova Yohani ahengili lepi gachinamtiti gogoha, “Nambu goha geajovili kumvala mundu uyu ndi chakaka neju.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Vandu vamahele pandu penapo vakamsadika Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Lifwa la Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Mundu mmonga liina laki Lazalu avi mtamu. Mundu mwenuyo avili mkolonjinji wa Betania, valumbu vaki Maliya na Malita vatamayi chijiji chila. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maliya ndi yula mweamnyalili Bambu mahuta geginungalila bwina mumagendelu gaki na kumuungula na mayunju gaki. Lazalu mweavimtamu ndi mhaja wa Maliya. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Hinu, valumbu vala vatumili ujumbi kwa Yesu. “Bambu, nkozi waku mtamu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu mwene peagayuwini genago, akajova, “Utamu wenuwu wileta lepi lifwa, uhumalili muni Chapanga apewa ukulu na Mwana wa Chapanga mewa apewa ukulu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu avaganili Malita na Maliya pamonga na mlongo wavi Lazalu. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Peayuwini kuvya Lazalu mtamu, Yesu akahamba kutama peavili magono gavili. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Kangi akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Tihamba kavili ku Yudea!”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Vawuliwa vala vakamjovela, “Muwula, lukumbi luhupi ndu lupitili Vayawudi vaganili kukukoma na maganga, hinu wigana kuhamba kwenuko kavili?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu akavayangula “Wu, kuvi lepi masaa kumi na gavili ga muhi? Hinu mundu akagendayi muhi nakuhotola kujikuvala ndava ihotola kulola lumuli lwa mulima. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Nambu mundu akagendayi kilu akujikuvala ndava muni kawaka lumuli.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu peamali kujova malovi genago, akavajovela “Nkozi witu Lazalu agonili, nambu nene yati nihamba kumuyumusa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Vawuliwa vaki vakamjovela, “Bambu yikavya agonili yati ilama.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Vene vaholalili kuvya ajovili kugona lugono, nambu Yesu ajovili kumvala lifwa la Lazalu. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ndi Yesu akavajovela hotohoto kuvya “Lazalu afwili, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Nambu ndava yinu nivii na luheku ndava navi lepi kwenuko, muni musadika. Hinu tihamba kwa Lazalu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi mweikemelewa mpaha, akavajovela vawuliwa vayaki, “Tihamba na tete tikafwayi pamonga na Yesu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi uyukisa na wumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu peahikili kwenuko, amkolili Lazalu amali kuvya mulitinda magono mcheche. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Chijiji cha Betania chavi papipi na Yelusalemu, utali waki wavi kilomita zidatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Vayawudi vamahele vahikili kwa Malita na Maliya kuvapolesa mitima ndava mhaja wavi afwili.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Hinu, Malita peayuwini kuvya Yesu ibwela, akahamba kumpokela, nambu Maliya asigalili kunyumba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malita amjovili Yesu, “Bambu, Ngati ngauvyayi apa, mhaja wangu ngaafwili lepi. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Nambu nimanyili kuvya hati hinu, chochoha cheukumuyupa Chapanga yati akupela.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu akamjovela, “Mhaja waku yati iyuka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malita akayangula, “Nimanyili kuvya yati iyuka lukumbi Chapanga peakuvayukisa vevafwili.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu akamjovela, “Nene ndi mweniyukisa vandu na kuvapela vandu wumi. Mweakunisadika nene hati ngati afwili, yati itama, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />mewawa mundu yoyoha mweitama na kunisadika, katu ifwa lepi. Wu, wisadika genago?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malita akayangula “Ena Bambu! Nene nisadika kuvya veve ndi Kilisitu, Mwana wa Chapanga, yula mweibwela pamulima.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ivemba maholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Peamalii kujova genago, Malita akahamba kumkemela mlumbu waki Maliya, akamjovela pachiepela, “Muwula avi penapa, akukemela.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maliya peayuwini malovi ago, bahapo akayima kanyata akamuhambila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu avi akona kuyingila pachijiji, ndi avi pandu palapala pavakonganiki na Malita. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Vayawudi vevampolesa mtima Maliya panyumba pala, pavamuwene Maliya awukili chigafula, vakamlanda. Vaholalili kuvya ihamba kuvemba kulitinda.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Maliya peahikili pandu pala peavili Yesu na kumlola akamfugamila, akamjovela, “Bambu ngati kuvya uvya apa, mhaja wangu ngaafwili lepi!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu peamuwene Maliya ivemba na Vayawudi vevamlandili mewa vivemba, ndi akavya ngolongondi na kuviniswa mumtima. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Kangi akavakota, “Mumvikili koki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Vakamjovela “Bambu, ubwela ulolayi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu akavemba maholi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Hinu, Vayawudi vakajova, “Mlola cheamganili Lazalu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Nambu vangi vakajova, “Wu, mwenuyu ndi yula mweamdindwili mihu ngalola, hinu ahotwili lepi kukita Lazalu akoto kufwa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumyukisa Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu iviniswa mtima kavili, akahika kulitinda. Litinda lene lavi mbugu levadivalili liganga pamlyangu waki. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu akavajovela, “Muwusa liganga lenili!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Malita mlumbu wa yula mweafwili akamjovela. “Bambu atumbwili kununga muni atamii mulitinda mula magono mcheche!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu akamjovela, “Wu, nene nakujovili lepi ukasadika yati ulola ukulu wa Chapanga?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ndi vakaliwusa liganga lila. Yesu akalolokesa kunani kwa Chapanga, akajova “Dadi nikusengusa muni ukuniyuwana. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Nimanyili kuvya ukuniyuwana magono goha. Nambu nijovili genaga ndava ya vandu vevavi apa vasadikayi kuvya veve ndi mweunitumili.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Peamali kujova genago, Akakemela kwa lwami luvaha, “Lazalu! Huma kuvala!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Mweafwili yula akahuma kuvala, kuni vamtindisili nyula ya msopi mumagendelu na mumawoko na pamihu poha. Yesu akavajovela, “Mumnyembelula, mumleka ahamba mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi viyidakilana kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matei 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Vayawudi vamahele vevabwelili kwa Maliya na kulilola lijambu leahengili Yesu. Ndi vakamsadika. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Nambu vangi vavi vakahamba kwa Vafalisayu vakavadandaulila lijambu leahengili Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Vakulu va kuteta na Vafalisayu vakakonganeka na vandu Libanji la Vayawudi vakakota, “Tikita wuli? Mundu uyu ihenga milangisu yamahele neju.<figure style="fig" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Mkulu wa kuteta wa Chiyawudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Takamlekayi vandu voha yati vamsadika, na vakulu va ku Loma yati vibwela na kudenya Nyumba yitu ya Chapanga pamonga na mulima na vandu vitu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Mmonga wavi liina laki Kayafa, mweavi Mkulu wa Vateta wa mwaka wenuwo, akavajovela, “Nyenye nakumanya chindu! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Mwimanya lepi, ndi mbanga pagati yinu mundu mmonga afwayi ndava ya vandu, kuliku vandu voha va mulima witu vakomiwayi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Mwene ajovili lepi kwa luhala lwaki, nambu ndava avi Mteta mkulu mwaka wenuwo, ndi alotili kuvya Yesu yati ifwa ndava ya Vayawudi, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />lepi ndava ya Vayawudi vene ndu, nambu mewa ndava ya vandu voha va Chapanga vevapechangini, muni avaletayi pamonga na kuvakita vavyayi na umonga.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Kutumbula ligono lenilo vachilongosi va Vayawudi vayidakilini kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Hinu Yesu agendili lepi hotohoto pagati ya Vayawudi, akawuka pandu pala akahamba pandu pepavi papipi na lugangatu. Pamuji wewukemelewa Efulaimu. Akatama kwenuko pamonga na vawuliwa vaki.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Mselebuko wa Vayawudi Pasaka wavi papipi, na vandu vamahele vahambili ku Yelusalemu muni vahenga malagizu ga kujinyambisa vene muni kumuyupa Chapanga, kwakona mselebuko wenuwo. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Vakavya kumulonda Yesu. Pevakonganiki pamonga Panyumba ya Chapanga. Vakakotana, “Yivya wuli? Yilolekana ibwela lepi pa mselebuko wenuwu? Amala wuli?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Vakulu va kuteta na Vafalisayu valagazili kuvya mundu akamanyayi kweavili Yesu, avajovelayi muni vamukamulayi.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maliya akumnyala Yesu mahuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matei 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Magono sita kwakona mselebuko wa Pasaka, Yesu ahikili ku Betania kweatamayi Lazalu, mundu yula mweamyukisi. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Kwenuko vamtendelakili chakulya cha kimihi, Malita akavya kuvahengela. Lazalu avi mmonga wa vala vevatamili pameza pamonga na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Kangi Maliya akatola libotolo la pinga la mahuta geginungalila bwina, gegatenganizwi kwa mkongo wa nado, gegiguliswa kwa mashonga gamahele, akamnyala Yesu mumagendelu na kuhungula kwa mayunju gaki. Nyumba yoha yikanungalila mahuta gala. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Nambu Yuda Isikalioti mmonga wa vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili vala ndi mweabweli kumng'anamukila Yesu, akajova, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />Ndava kyani mahuta ago gaguliswi lepi kwa hipandi miya zidatu ya madini ga feza, vapewayi vangangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ajovili genago lepi ndava ya lipyana kwa vangangu, nambu avi mvika kahaku ka mashonga. Na pamahele ayivayi mashonga gegavikwayi mu kahaku kala muni avi mhiji.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Nambu Yesu akajova, “Mkoto kumung'aha mau mwenuyu! Muleka agavika ndava ya ligono la kunizika. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Vangangu yati mwivya nawu magono goha, nambu mwivya lepi na nene magono goha.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi viakilana kumkoma Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Vayawudi vamahele vayuwini kuvya Yesu avi ku Betania. Vakahika kwenuko lepi ndava ya kumlola Yesu ndi ndava ya kumlola Lazalu mweayukiswi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Hinu Vamteta vakulu mewawa vayidakilini kumkoma lazalu. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Ndava ya kuyukiswa kwa Lazalu Vayawudi vamahele vavabelili vachilongosi wavi, vakamsadika Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iyingila ku Yelusalemu kwa chilulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matei 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Chilau yaki, msambi uvaha wa vandu vevabwelili kumselebuko vakayuwana Yesu avi munjila kubwela pa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Hinu vakatola matutu ga mavali, vakawuka kuhamba kumpokela, vakajova kwa lwami luvaha. “Chapanga alumbiwa! Amotisiwa mwenuyo mweibwela kwa liina la Bambu. Amotisiwa Nkosi wa Isilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu akapewa mwana lipunda, akakwela panani yaki ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi.<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Vandu va muji wa Siyoni mkotoka kuyogopa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Ulola, Nkosi waku ibwela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Akweli mwana lipunda!”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Vawuliwa vaki nakumanya mambu ago, nambu Yesu peamali kupewa ukulu, ndi vakamanya kuvya gala gamali kuyandikwa kumvala mwene, kuvya vandu vamkitili genago.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Msambi wa vandu vala vevavi pamonga na Yesu ligono leamkemili Lazalu kuhuma mulitinda, amyukisi. Vavajovili vandu mambu gala gegahumalili. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ndava ya yeniyo msambi wa vandu ukahamba kumpokela, muni vayuwini kuvya akitili chinamtiti chenicho. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Hinu Vafalisayu vakakotana vene kwa vene, “Wu, mwilola? Nakuhotola kukita chochoha! Mlolayi, vandu voha va mulima vakumlanda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vagiliki vangi vigana kumlola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kwavi na Vagiliki vadebe pagati ya vandu vala vevahikili ku Yelusalemu kumfugamila lukumbi lwa mselebuko wa pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Venavo vamhambili Filipi, mkolonjinji wa Betisaida mweavili pamulima wa Galilaya, vakajova “Mtopeswa tete tigana kumlola Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipi akahamba kumjovela Andelea, voha vavili vakahamba kumjovela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu akavajovela, “Saa ya Mwana wa Mundu kupewa ukulu yihikili.” <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Chakaka nikujovela, mbeyu ya nganu yisigalila kuvya mbeyu ndu, mbaka yigwai muludaka na kufwa. Ngati yikafwayi ndi yimela na kupambika mbeyu yamahele. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Mundu yoyoha mweakuugana wumi waki yati akuuyagisa, nambu mundu yoyoha mweakuuyomela wumi waki pamulima apa, akuuvika wumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Mundu mweigana kunihengala yikumgana kunilanda, mewa pala penivya nene, ndi peivya mtangatila wangu. Mundu akanihengelayi nene Dadi wangu yati akumtopesa.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova kujivala lifwa laki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Hinu mpungu wangu uvagaya, nijova wuli? ‘Dadi unisangulayi na lukumbi lwenulo?’ Nambu ndava ya genago nibwelili muni nipitilayi lukumbi ulu lwa mang'ahiso. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Dadi, ugubukula ukulu waku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Penapo lwami lukajova kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, “Nimali kuugubukula ukulu wangu na yati nikuugubukula kavili.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Msambi wa vandu vevayimili penapo vayuwini lwami lula, nambu vangi vavi vakajova, mbulumu na vangi vakajova “Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga alongili naku!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Malovi gemuyuwini lepi ndava ya nene, nambu ndava ya nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Hinu ndi lukumbi lwa vandu va mulima uwu kuhamuliwa, Setani mweavi chilongosi wa mulima uwu yati ivingiwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nene peniyinuliwa panani kuhuma pamulima yati kila mmonga yati ihutika kwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Ajovili genago kulangisa lifwa leifwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Hinu, msambi wa vandu wula ukamyangula “Tete tijoviwi na malagizu gitu kuvya Kilisitu yati ilama magono goha. Hinu uhotola wuli, kujova yikumgana Mwana wa Mundu kuyinuliwa? Mwana wa mundu mwenuyo ndi yani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu akavajovela, “Lumuli lwakona na nyenye mu lukumbi luhupi. Mgenda kwakona muvi nalu lumuli lwenulo muni chitita chikoto kuvakolela, muni mweigenda muchitita angamanya kweihamba. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Lukumbi muvi na lumuli mwasadiki lumuli lwenulo muni mpata kuvya vandu va lumuli.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Vayawudi vibela kumsadika Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Peamali kujova malovi genago, Yesu akawuka mwene na kuhamba kujifiya patali na vandu. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Nambu pamonga Yesu ahengili gachinamtiti goha palongolo yavi, vene vamsadiki lepi. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Hinu malovi geajovili Isaya mweavili mlota wa Chapanga gakatimalila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Bambu, yani mweasadiki ujumbi witu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Na uhotola wa Bambu agubukuliwi yani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Mewa vangahotola kusadika ndava Isaya ajovili kavili,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Chapanga agakoywisi mihu gavi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Avahimwisi luhala lwavi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Vakoto kulola kwa mihu gavi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Vakoto kumanya kwa luhala lwavi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Nambu vakoto kuniwuyila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Muni nivalamisa.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya ajovili ndava auwene ukulu wa Yesu na kujova ndava ya Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Pamonga na ago, vachilongosi vamahele va Vayawudi vamsadiki Yesu. Nambu ndava ya kuvayogopa Vafalisayu nakujova hotohoto. Vayogwipi kuvingiwa munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Ndava muni vachilongosi avo vaganili kukwihiwa na vandu kuliku kukwihiwa na Chapanga.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malovi ga Yesu yati gakuvahamula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Kangi Yesu akajova, kwa lwami luvaha, “Mundu mweakunisadika nene, akunisadika lepi namwene ndu, mewawa akumsadika yula mweanitumili nene. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Mweakunilola nene mewawa akumlola yula mweanitumili. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Nene nibwelili pamulima muni nivyayi lumuli, mundu yoyoha mweakunisadika akotoka kusigalila muchitita. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Mundu yoyoha mweiyuwana malovi gangu, na akugahengela lepi, nene nikumuhamula lepi. Muni nibweli hee ndava ya kuvahamula vandu va mumulima nambu kuvasangula. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Yula mweakunibela nene, mweangayidakila malovi gangu avi naku wa kumuhamula. Malovi ga Yesu yati gakuvahamula vandu ligono la mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Nene nakujova kwa uhotola wangu namwene, nambu Dadi mweanitumili ndi mweanijovela nijova kyani na cheyiganikiwa kuvajovela vandu. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Nene nimanyili kuvya mihilu yaki yileta wumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu. Hinu nene nijova gala ndu geanilagizi Dadi kujova.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvasanja vawuliwa vaki magendelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Yavili kwakona mselebuko wa pasaka kuhika, Yesu kuni amanyili lukumbi lwa kuwuka kwaki pamulima luhikili kuhamba kwa Dadi waki. Yesu avaganili neju vandu vaki vevavi pamulima na avaganili kwa uganu wangali mwishu.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yavi lukumbi lwa chakulya cha kimihi. Setani amali kuyingi mumtima wa Yuda Isikalioti mwana wa Simoni, na kumpela maholo ga kumng'anamukila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu amanyili kuvya Dadi amgotolili vindu vyoha muuhotola waki, mewawa kuvya ahumili kwa Chapanga na iwuya kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Yesu akawuka pachakulya pala, akavika pamuhana nyula yaki ya kujihwika, akatola chitambala na kujikunga muchiwunu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Kangi akasopa manji munkele livaha na kutumbula kuvasambisa vawuliwa vaki magendelu na kuhungula na chitambala chila cheajikungili muchiwunu. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Peamhikili Simoni Petili, Petili mwene akajova, “Bambu, veve yati ukunisanja magendelu nene?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu akayangula, “Wimanya lepi chenihenga hinu, nambu yati wimanya mwanakandahi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petili akamjovela, “Veve ukunisanja lepi magendelu katu!” Yesu akamyangula, “Changali kukusanja magendelu gaku wivya lepi muwuliwa wangu kavili.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petili akamyangula, “Bambu, unisanja, lepi magendelu gene, ndi pamonga na mawoko gangu mewawa na mutu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu akamjovela, “Mundu mweamali kusamba ndi amali kunyamba iganikiwa kusanja magendelu ndu. Nyenye munyambili nambu mwavoha lepi.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu ammanyili yula mweakumng'anamukila, ndi mana ajovili, “Nyenye mnyambili, nambu mwavoha lepi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Yesu peamali kuvasambisa magendelu na kuwala kavili nyula yaki, akatama, peatamili akavajovela, “Wu, mmanyili aga genivakitili?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Nyenye mukunikemela Muwula na Bambu mwijova chakaka, muni nene ndi chenivii. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Yakavyai nene mwenivii Bambu na Muwula nivasambisi nyenye magendelu, mewawa na nyenye yikuvagana musanjanayi magendelu nyenye mwavene. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Nivapeli luhumu, muni nyenye mewa muhengayi ngati chenivahengili. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, mtangatila mkulu lepi kuliku mtopeswa waki, mewawa mjumbi mkulu lepi kuliku mweamtumili yula. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Hinu, ndava muni mukugamanya mambu ago, yati mmotisiwa ngati mukugahenga.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Nijova lepi kuvavala mwavoha. Nivamanyili venivahagwili vala, nambu Mayandiku Gamsopi giganikiwa gatimilayi, mundu mwealili chakulya pamonga na nene aning'anamukili. <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />“Nene nivajovili mambu aga kwakona kuhumila, muni pegihumila muhotola kusadika, ‘Nene Ndi Mwene.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, yula mweakumpokela mundu yoyoha mwenimtumili, akunipokela nene, na mweakunipokela nene akumpokela mwene mweanitumili.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilota kuvya yati igotolewa kwa makoko vaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matei 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maluko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Peamali kujova genago, Yesu akaviniswa neju mumtima, akajova hotohoto, “Chakaka nikuvajovela mmonga winu yati akuning'anamukila!”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Vawuliwa vakalolesana kuni nakuhotola kummanya akumjova yani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mmonga wa vawuliwa, Yesu mweamganili neju, atamili papipi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Hinu Simoni Petili akumkonya lihu muwuliwa yula “Amkotayi ijova kumvala yani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Muwuliwa mwenuyu akahegelela papipi na Yesu, akamkota “Bambu ndi yani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu akayangula, “Mundu yula mwenikumpela chipandi cha libumunda chenijwigi munkele ndi mwenuyo.” Ndi akatola chipandi cha libumunda akachijwiga munkele na kumpela Yuda, mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda peamali kupokela chipandi chila, Setani akamuyingila. Hinu Yesu akamjovela “Chewigana kukita kita kanyata!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Nambu kawaka hati mmonga ya vala vevatamii pachakulya mweamanyili ndava kyani amjovili genago. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Ndava muni Yuda avi mvika lihaku la mashonga, vangi vaholali kuvya Yesu amjovili manya akagula vindu vyeviganikiwa pamselebuko wa Pasaka, amala avapelayi vangangu vindu.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuda peamali kutola chipandi chila cha libumunda, bahapo akahuma kuvala. Na yavili kilu.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhilu wa mupya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda peamali kuwuka, Yesu akajova, “Hinu ukulu wa Mwana wa Mundu ugubukuliwi, na ukulu wa Chapanga ugubukuliwi mugati yaki.” <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Ngati ukulu wa Chapanga ulangiswi mugati ya Mwana, hinu Chapanga yati akuulangisa ukulu wa Mwana mugati yaki mwene yati ikita ago kanyata. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />“Nyenye vana vangu, nakona niviii pamonga na nyenye mulukumbi luhupi ndu. Yati mukunilonda, nambu nikuvajovela galagala genavajovili vachilongosi va Vayawudi kuvya, ‘Kwenihamba nene, nyenye nakuhotola kuhamba.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Nikuvapela muhilu wa mupya mgananayi. Mgananayi ngati nene chenavaganili nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Mukagananayi, vandu voha yati vimanya kuvya nyenye ndi vawuliwa vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova kuvya Petili akumbela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matei 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petili akamkota, “Bambu, wihamba koki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu akayangula “Kwenihamba uhotola lepi kunilanda hinu, nambu yati ukunilanda mwanakandahi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petili akamkota kavili, “Bambu, Ndava kyani nihotola lepi kukulanda hinu? Nene nihotola kufwa ndava yaku!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu akayangula, “Wu, uhotola chakaka kufwa ndava yangu? Chakaka nikukujovela, kwakona lijogolo kuvika ukunibela mala zidatu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi njila ya kuhamba kwa Dadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu akavajovela, mkoto kuviniswa mumitima yinu. “Mukumsadika Chapanga, munisadika na nene mewa. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Munyumba ya Dadi wangu muvi na vyumba vyamahele, ngati lepi nganamali kuvajovela. Muni hinu nihamba kuvatendelekela fwasi ndava yinu. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Nene nikahambayi na kuvatendelekela fwasi ndava yinu, yati niwuya kuvatola mbwela kwa nene, muni na nyenye mvya pandu penivya nene. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Nyenye mukuyimanya njila ya kuhamba kwenihamba.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi akamkota, “Bambu, nimanya lepi kwewihamba, tihotola wuli kumanya njila yeniyo?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu akamyangula, “Nene ndi njila na uchakaka na wumi wene. Kawaka mundu mweihotola kuhamba kwa Dadi changali kupitila kwa nene. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ngati mukunimanya nene, mewawa mukummanya na Dadi. Kutumbula hinu mukummanya, kangi mmali kumuwona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipi akamjovela, “Bambu, utilangisa Dadi, genago ndu tete tigana.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu akamyangula, Filipi unimanyili lepi nene, hati pamonga nitamii na nyenye lukumbi lutali? Mundu yoyoha mweaniweni nene, amuweni Dadi. Uhotola wuli kujova utilangisa Dadi? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Wu, wisadika lepi kuvya nene nivii mugati ya Dadi na Dadi avi mugati ya nene? Malovi genikuvajovela. Nakugajova kwa uhotola wangu, Dadi mweavimugati ya nene, ihenga lihengu laki. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Muganikiwa kusadika penijova nivii mugati ya Dadi na Dadi avi mugati ya nene, ngati lepi. Musadika ndava ya mahengu gala genihengili. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, mundu yoyoha mweakunisadika nene. Ena yati ihenga mahengu gakulu hati gakulu neju, ndava nihamba kwa Dadi. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Na chochoha chemwiyupa kwa liina langu yati nikuchihenga, muni ukulu wa Dadi ulumbiwa munjila ya Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Mwakaniyupa chochoha kwa liina langu yati nikuvahengela.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova akumtuma Mpungu Msopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Ngati mkunigana nene, myidakila mihilu yangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nene yati nikumuyupa Dadi mwene yati akuvapela Mtangatila yungi, mweitama na nyenye magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Mwene ndi Mpungu Msopi mweakutijovela uchakaka kumvala Chapanga, nambu vandu va mulima nakuhotola kumpokela ndava vakumlola lepi amala kummanya. Nambu nyenye mukummanya ndava isigalila na nyenye na avi mugati yinu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Nikuvaleka lepi nyenye vakiva, yati nibwela kangi kwinu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Lwakona lukumbi luhupi, vandu va mulima yati vakuniwona lepi kavili. Nambu nyenye yati mukuniwona, ndava nene mumi mewa na nyenye yati mwiva vamumi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Ligono lenilo pelibwela nyenye yati mwimanya kuvya nene nivii mugati ya Dadi wangu, na nyenye mugati ya nene, mewa nene mugati yinu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Yula mweiyidakila mihilu yangu na kuzihenga, mwene ndi mweakunigana. Yula mweakunigana nene, Dadi wangu yati akumgana mwene, mewa na nene yati nikumgana na kujilangisa kwaki.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda lepi yula Yuda Isikalioti, akamjovela, “Bambu, ndava kyani ugana kujilangisa kwa tete lepi kwa vandu va mulima?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu akayangula, “Mundu akaniganayi yati iyidakila mawuliwu gangu. Dadi wangu yati akumgana, nene na Dadi wangu yati tibwela kwaki na kutama nayu.” <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Mundu mweanganigana, nakukamula mwawuliwu gangu. Malovi gemkugayuwana lepi gangu, ndi gihuma kwa Dadi mweanitumili.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Nivajovili mambu genaga kuni nakona pamonga na nyenye.” <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Nambu mtangatila, mwenuyo Mpungu Msopi, Dadi mweakumutuma kwa liina langu, yati akuvawula goha na kuvakumbusa goha genivajovili.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Nikuvalekela uteke, nikuvapela uteke wangu. Nakuvapela nyenye ngati vandu va mulima chevikita. Mkoto kuviniswa mumitima yinu amala kuvya na wogohi <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Myuwini chenijovili, ‘Nene nihamba, nambu yati niwuya kavili kwa nyenye.’ Ngati mukunigana, ngamuhekalili ndava nihamba kwa Dadi, muni mwene mkulu kuliku nene.” <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nivajovili genaga hinu kwakona kuhumila, muni pagibwela kuhumila musadikayi. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Nene nijova lepi na nyenye malovi gamahele kavili, muni Setani chilongosi wa mulima uwu ibwela. Kwa nene ihotola lepi chindu. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Nambu vandu va mulima viganikiwa kumanya nikumgana Dadi, na ndi nihenga kila chindu cheanilagizi Dadi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Myimayi, tiwukayi penapa!”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi mzabibu wa chakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Nene ndi mzabibu wa chakaka na Dadi wangu mwene ndi mulimaji. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Lipanda loloha mugati yangu langapambika matunda mwene akuliwusa, na lipanda loloha lelipambika akulikita livyayi bwina muni lipambikayi neju. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Nyenye mmali kunyamba ndava linenu lenavajovili lila. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Mtama mugati yangu, na nene nitama mugati yinu. Ngati lipanda nakuhotola kupapimbika lene ngati livili lepi palihina, mewawa nyenye nakuhotola kupambika ngati mutama lepi mugati ya nene.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Nene ndi mzabibu, na nyenye ndi mambanda. Mweitama mugati yangu, na nene nivyayi mugati yaki, mwenuyo ipambika gamahele, muni changali nene nakuhotola kuhenga chochoha. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mundu ngati itama lepi mugati yangu yati itagiwa kuvala ngati lipanda chelitagiwa kuvala na kuyuma. Lipanda ngati lenilo vandu vakulinonga na kulitaga pamotu litinyikayi. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ngati nyenye mwitama mugati yangu na malovi gangu yati gitama mugati yinu, muyupa chindu chochoha chemwigana yati mwipewa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ukulu wa Dadi wangu ulangasika ngati nyenye mwipambika matunda gamahele na kuvya vawuliwa vangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Nene nikuvagana nyenye ngati Dadi cheaniganili nene. Mtama muuganu wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mwakayidakila mihilu yangu yati itama mugati yangu, ngati nene cheniyidakili malagizu ga Dadi wangu na kutama muuganu waki.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Nivajovili mambu genaga muni luheku lwangu lutama mugati yinu, na luheku lwinu lutimila. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Mihilu yangu ndi iyi: Mgananayi, ngati chenikuvagana nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Kawaka mundu mweavi na uganu mkulu neju kuliku uwu, wa mundu kuwusa wumi waki ndava ya vankozi vaki. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Nyenye vankozi vangu mwakahenga chenivalagiza. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Nakuvakemela kavili vehengaji, muni mtangatila imanya lepi cheikita mtopeswa waki. Nambu nyenye nivakemili vankozi, ndava muni goha genayuwini kwa Dadi wangu nivajovili. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Nyenye mwanihagwili lepi nene, nambu nene ndi mwenivahagwili na kuvatuma mhamba mkapambika matunda ndi mahengu gabwina gegisigalia, mwene Dadi ahotola kuvapela chindu chochoa chemwiyupa kwa liina langu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Hinu, muhilu wangu ukulu ndi wenuwu mgananayi.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu va mulima vakuvayomela vawuliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Ngati vandu va mulima vakuvayomela nyenye, mkoto kukosiwa kuvya vakuniyomela nene kwakona kuvayomela nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Ngati nyenye kuvya vandu va pamulima, mulima ngauvaganili nyenye ngati vandu vaki. Nambu ndava nyenye vandu lepi va pamulima, ndi nene nivahagwili kuhuma pamulima, ndava ya genago vandu va mulima vakuvayomela. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Mkumbuka linenu lila lenivajovili, mtangatila lepi mkulu kuliku mtopeswa waki. Yakavya vanig'aisi nene, mewawa vakuvang'aisa na nyenye, ngati malovi gangu vagakamwili mewa vakugakamula na malovi ginu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Nambu genaga goha vakuvakitila ndava nyenye mukunisadika nene muni mwavandu vangu, ndava vakummanya lepi yula mweanitumili. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Ngati nabweli lepi na kulongela navu, ngavavalangiwi lepi vakumbudila Chapanga, nambu hinu nakuhotola kujova kuvya vambudili lepi Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Mundu yoyoha mweakuniyomela nene, mewawa akumyomela Dadi wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ngati nihengili lepi kwavi mambu gangahengeka na mundu yungi kwavi, ngavavalangiwi lepi vambudili Chapanga, nambu hinu vagaweni gachinamtiti genihengili ndi vaniyomili nene mewawa vamuyomili Dadi wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Nambu vahengili lijambu lenili muni malovi gegayandikwi mu Malagizu gatimilayi! “Vaniyomili waka!”<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Peibwela mtangatila mwenuyo mwenikumtuma kwinu kuhuma kwa Dadi, mwenuyo ndi Mpungu Msopi mweakuvajovela uchakaka kumvala Chapanga. Yati nikumtuma kwinu kuhuma kwa Dadi, mwene yati akuvajovela kunivala nene. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Nyenye mewa yati mukuvajovela vandu kunivala nene ndava muvi na nene kuhumila pakutumbula.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Nivajovili malovi genaga, muni mkoto kuleka kusadika. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Vandu yati vakuvavinga nyenye munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi. Kangi lukumbi lubwela mundu yoyoha mweakuvakoma nyenye yati iholalela akumhengela Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Mambu genago yati vakuvakitila ndava vangammanya Dadi, wala nene. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Hinu, nivajovili mambu ago muni lukumbi lwenulo paluhikayi mkoto kukosiwa kuvya navajovili.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Lihengu la Mpungu Msopi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Hinu, navajovili lepi mambu genaga tangia pakutumbula ndava navili pamonga na nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Nambu hinu nikumhambila mweanitumili yula, kawaka hati mmonga winu mweakunikota ‘Wihamba koki?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Ndava ya mambu genivajovili mitima yinu yivii ngolongondi neju. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Nambu nene nikuvajovela uchakaka, mbanga yinu nene nihamba, muni ngati nangahamba mtangatila nakubwela kwinu. Nambu nakahambayi, ndi, nikumtuma kwinu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Mwene peibwela yati akuvalangisa vandu va mulima kuvya vaumanyili lepi uchakaka kuvala kumbudila Chapanga, na kuyidakiliwa palongolo ya Chapanga na kuhamuliwa na Chapanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Vaumanyi lepi uchakaka kumvala kumbudila Chapanga muni vanisadiki lepi nene. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Vaumanyili lepi uchakaka ndava ya vandu kuyidakiliwa palongolo ya Chapanga, muni nihamba kwa Dadi, na nyenye nakuniwona kavili. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Vaumanyili lepi uchakaka kumvala Chapanga kuvahamula vandu, muni mkulu wa mulima uwu amali kuhamuliwa.”<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Nakona nivii nagu gamahele gakuvajovela, ndi kwa hinu muhotola lepi kugakamula goha. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Nambu peibwela mwene Mpungu Msopi mweakuvajovela uchakaka ndava ya Chapanga, yati akuvalongosa muuchakaka woha. Yati ijova lepi kwa uhotola waki mwene, nambu yati ijova geagayuwini kuhuma kwa Dadi na kuvajovela gegibwela. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Mwene yati akunipela ukulu nene ndava muni yati akuvamanyisa gegihuma kwa nene gala. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Goha geavinagu Dadi ndi ga nene, ndi nijova kuvya Mpungu Msopi mwenuyo yati akuvajovela gegihuma kwa nene.”<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ungolongondi yati ung'anamuka kuvya luheku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Lusigalili lukumbi luhupi nyenye nakuniwona, na kangi lukumbi luhupi kavili yati mukuniwona!”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Vawuliwa vaki vangi vakakotana, “Mana yaki kyani? Peakutijovela, lwakona lukumbi luhupi nakumuwona na kavili lukumbi luhupi yati mukuniwona na kangi ijova ndava muni nihamba kwa Dadi!” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Hinu vakavya mkukotana, “Linenu lenili leijova, lusigalili lukumbi luhupi ndi kyani? Timanyi lepi ijova kyani.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu amanyili kuvya vigana kumkota, mwene akavajovela, wu, mkotana ndava ya gala genavajovili. Lwakona lukumbi luhupi na nyenye nakuniwona, na kangi lukumbi luhupi yati mukuniwona kavili? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, nyenye yati muvemba na kulola mvinisu mumtima winu, nambu vandu va mulima yati viheka. Mwalavya ngolongondi nambu ngolongondi yati ying'anamuka na kuvya luheku. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mdala peiveleka ivya ngolongondi ndava lukumbi lwa mvinisu luhikili, nambu akamala kuveleka mwana ikosiwa mvinisu wula, ndava ya luheku lwa mwana avelekiwi pamulima. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Mewawa nyenye mwava ngolongondi hinu, nambu nalavabwelela kavili, na nyenye luheku yati lumema mu mitima yinu kawaka mundu mweiwusa luheku lwinu.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Ligono lenilo nakuniyupa chochoha. Chakaka nikuvajovela, chindu chochoha chemukumuyupa Dadi kwa liina langu yati akuvapela. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mbaka hinu nakumuyupa chochoha kwa liina langu. Myupa na nyenye yati mwipewa, muni luheku lwinu lutimila.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auhotwili mulima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Nivajovili mambu genago kwa luhumu. Nambu lukumbi lubwela penapo nakujova kavili kwa luhumu, ndi nikuvajovela hotohoto kumvala Dadi, <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />ligono ilo, yati muyupa kwa liina langu, amala nikuvajovela lepi kuvya yati niyupa kwa Dadi ndava yinu, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Ndava muni Dadi mwene akuvagana. Akuvagana ndava nyenye mukunigana nene na kunisadika, kuvya nihumili kwa Dadi. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nene nihumili kwa Dadi, nikabwela pamulima apa, kavili nikuuleka mulima na kuwuya kwa Dadi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Vawuliwa vaki vakamjovela, “Lola! Hinu ulongela hotohoto, changali kujova kwa miluhumu. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Hinu timanyili kuvya veve ukugamanya mambu goha, amala kawaka ndava ya mundu kukota chindu, ndi tisadika kuvya wahumili kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu akavayangula, “Wu, hinu mwisadika? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Nambu lukumbi luhika, kangi lumali kuhika, ndi mwavoha nyenye yati mupechengana kila mmonga kwaki, na kunileka namwene. Nambu nene nakuvya namwene, ndava muni Dadi avi pamonga na nene. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Nivajovili mambu genaga, muni mvya na uteke mukuwungana na nene. Pamulima yati mwipata mang'ahiso, nambu mkangamala mumitima! Nene niuhotwili mulima!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvayupila vawuliwa vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu peamali kujova genago, akalolokesa kunani kwa Chapanga, akajova, “Dadi, lukumbi luhikili! Mpela ukulu Mwana waku muni namwene Mwana akupela ukulu.” <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ndava muni wampeli Mwana waku uhotola kwa vandu voha muni vandu venavo veumpeli avapelayi wumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Wumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu ndi uwu, vandu vakumanya veve, mweuvi wamwene Chapanga wa chakaka, na kummanya Yesu Kilisitu mweumtumili. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Nene niulangisi ukulu pamulima apa, nimali lihengu lila lewanipeli nihengayi. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Hinu, Dadi unipela ukulu palongolo yaku, ukulu wulawula wenavi nawu kwakona kuwumbwa mulima.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Nikukitili umanyikanayi na vandu vala vewanipelili kuhuma pamulima. Vandu vevavi vaku, veve wanipeli vavyai vangu, navene valikamwili linenu laku. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Hinu vamanyili kuvya kila chewanipeli chihumili kwaku. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Nene nivapeli ujumbi wula weunipeli, vene vaupokili, vamanyili chakaka nihumili kwa veve, na vasadiki kuvya veve ndi mweunitumili.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Nikuvayupila avo, nikuvayupila lepi vandu va mulima, nambu nivayupila vala veunipelili, muni ndi vaku.” <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Goha genivii nagu ndi gaku, na gaku ndi gangu, na ukulu wangu, ulolikini pagati ya avo weunipeli. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Na hinu nivii lepi kangi pamulima, nambu vene vavi pamulima. Dadi Msopi! Kwa makakala ga liina laku leunipeli, chondi uvavikila ulonda muni vavyai chindu chimonga ngati chetivili tete tavamonga. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Panakavi pamonga navu, nene navavikii ulonda kwa makakala ga liina laku leunipeli, nene navavikii ulonda, kawaka mmonga wavi mweayagili, muni yula mmonga mweahaguliwi kuyaga, muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gatimilayi. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Na hinu nibwela kwa veve, malovi aga nijovili pamulima, muni vamema luheku lwangu mumitima yavi. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nene navapeli ujumbi waku, na vandu va pamulima vakavayomela, ndava vene lepi va pamulima, ngati mewa chenivii nene lepi wa pamulima. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Niyupa lepi uvawusa pamulima, nambu niyupa uvavikila ulonda na yula mhakau ndi Setani. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Vene lepi va pamulima, ngati mewa chenivii nene lepi wa pamulima. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Uvakita vandu vaku vavya vamsopi kupitila uchakaka waku, na linenu laku ndi chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ngati veve chawanitumili nene pamulima, mewawa na nene nivatumili vene pamulima. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Ndava yavi na nene namwene nikujiwusa kwaku, muni navene vajiwusayi kwaku muchakaka.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Nikuvayupila lepi venava ndu, nikuvayupila mewa na vala vevakunisadika kupitila ujumbi wavi.” <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Niyupa muni voha vavyai chindu chimonga. Dadi, niyupa vavyai mugati yitu ngati veve cheuvi mugati yangu na nene mugati yaku. Nivayupili vene kuvya chindu chimonga muni mulima usadika kuvya veve ndi wanitumili. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nene nivapeli ukulu wulawula, wewanipeli nene, muni vavyai chindu chimonga ngati tete chetivii mmonga. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Nene nivyai mugati yavi, na veve uvyai mugati yangu. Niyupa vakamilika na chindu chimonga muni vandu va mulima vapata kumanya kuvya veve ndi mwewanitumili. Ukavagana vene ngati chawaniganili nene.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Dadi, nigana venavo veunipelili vavyai pamonga na nene pala penivya nene, muni valolayi ukulu wangu weunipelili, ndava muni waniganili kwakona mulima kuwumbwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Dadi Mbwina! Vandu va pamulima nakukumanya, nambu nene nikumanyili. Navene vakumanyili kuvya veve ndi mweunitumili. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nikukitili vakumanya veve na niyendelela kukita mewa muni uganu weuvi nawu kwangu uvya mugati yavi, na nene nivya mugati yavi.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ikamuliwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matei 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu peamali kujova genago, akakupuka kamfuleni kekikemelewa Keduloni, pamonga na vawuliwa vaki. Pandu apo pavi na lidimba, Yesu akayingila pamonga na vawuliwa vaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, mweamng'anamukili Yesu, apamanyili pandu penapo, ndava Yesu ahambayi pamahele Yesu akonganiki na vawuliwa vaki kwenuko. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Hinu, Yuda atoli msambi wa manjolinjoli va Chilumi na valonda va Nyumba ya Chapanga, kuhuma kwa vakulu va vateta na Vafalisayu, akabwela navu palidimba kuni vagegi hahi na lumuli na migoha na vibonga. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu, kuni imanya gegakumkolela, akavahegelela, akavakota, “Mukumulonda yani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Vene vakamyangula, “Yesu Mnazaleti!” Yesu akavajovela, “Nene, ndi mwene.” Yuda mweakumung'anamukila yula ayimili bahapo pamonga navu. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu peavajovili, “Nene ndi mwene.” Vakawuya mumbele vakagwa pahi.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Mwene akavakota kavili, “Mukumulonda yani?” Vakamyangula, “Yesu Mnazaleti!”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu akavayangula, “Nimali kuvajovela kuvya mwene ndi nene, ndava mukunilonda nene muvaleka ava vahamba.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Ajovili genago muni gatimilayi geajovili gala, “Dadi vala vewanipelili nakumyagisa hati mmonga.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Petili avi na upanga, ndi akauholomola, na kumdumula likutu la kulyela mtangatila wa Mteta Mkulu. Mtumisi mwenuyo liina laki Maluko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu akamyangula, Petili, “Wuyisa upanga muchihaku. Wu, chikombi cha mang'ahiso cheanipeli Dadi nikotoka kunywa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ipelekwa kwa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Msambi wa manjolinjoli va Chilumi pamonga na vakulu vavi, na valonda va Vayawudi vamkamwili Yesu, vakamkunga, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />na kumupeleka hoti kwa Anasi, Anasi avi mkohanu wa Kayafa mweavi Mteta Mkulu mwaka wenuwo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa ndi yula mweavajovili vachilongosi va Vayawudi kuvya mbanga mundu mmonga afwayi ndava ya vandu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumbela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matei 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maluko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petili pamonga na muwuliwa yungi vamlandili Yesu. Muwuliwa mwenuyo amanyikini kwa Mteta Mkulu, akayingila pamonga na Yesu mu luvanja lwa Mteta Mkulu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Nambu Petili ayimili kuvala ya mlyangu. Yula muwuliwa yungi, mweamanyikini kwa mteta mkulu, akahuma kuvala na kujova na msikana mlonda wa mlyangu, akamyingisa Petili mugati.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Msikana mlonda wa mlyangu, akamkota Petili, “Wu, na veve mmonga wa vawuliwa va mundu uyu?” Petili akamjovela, “Nene lepi!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Vatumisi na valonda vayota motu ndava kwavi na mbepu. Petili namwene ayimili na vayaki kuyota motu.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu palongolo ya mkulu wa vateta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matei 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Mteta mkulu akamkota Yesu kumvala mawuliwu gaki pamonga na vawuliwa vaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu akamyangula, “Nijovili na kila mundu hotohoto ligono kwa ligono. Magono goha navawulili munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, pandu pevikonganeka Vayawudi voha, na nakujova chamfiyu. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ndava kyani ukunikota nene? Uvakota vala vevayuwini navajovili kyani. Vene vimanya chenavajovili.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Peamali kujova genago mlonda mmonga mweayimili papipi, akampamanda Yesu, akamjovela, “Wu, ndi chaukumyangula Mteta Mkulu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu akamyangula, “Ngati nijovili uhakau langisa uhakau wene, nambu ngati nijovili chakaka, ndava kyani ukunitova?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Hinu, Anasi ampeliki Yesu kwa Kayafa kuni akungiwi, mweavi mteta mkulu.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumbela kavili Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matei 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maluko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Petili ayimili penapo kuyota motu. Hinu vakamkota, “Wu, veve mmonga wa vawuliwa vaki?” Mwene akabela na kujova, “Nene lepi!”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Mmonga wa vatumisi wa Mteta Mkulu, muyaki yula mweadumuliwi likutu na Petili, akamkota “Wu, nene nakuwene lepi veve kulidimba pamonga naku?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Kangi Petili akabela kavili, bahapo lijogolo likavika.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu palongolo ya Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matei 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Kangi vakamtola Yesu kuhuma kwa Kayafa, vampeliki kunyumba ya chinkosi. Yavi hamba kucha, muni vanyambasika palongolo ya Chapanga. Vahotola kulya Pasaka vene vayingili lepi munyumba ya chilongosi wa Loma vakotoka kuhakaswa. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Pilatu avahumila chakuvala, akavakota, “Lijambu loki lemukumtakila mundu uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Vakamyangula, “Ngati mwenuyu kuvya abudili lepi ngatimletili lepi kwaku.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilatu akavajovela, “Ena, mumtola mumuhamula mwavene, kulandana na malagizu ginu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Vayawudi vakamyangula, “Tete tivii lepi na uhotola wa kumuhamula mundu yoyoha afwayi.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Yakitiki ago gatimilayi malovi geajovili Yesu kulangisa yati ifwa namuna yoki.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilatu akayingila kavili munyumba yaki, akamkemela Yesu na kumkota. “Ati veve ndi Nkosi wa Vayawudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu akamyangula, “Wu, genago maholo gaku amala vandu vangi vakujovili kunivala nene?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilatu akayangula, “Mwe! Myawudi nene? Vandu vaku na vakulu va kuteta vakuletili kwa nene. Uhengili kyani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu akayangula, “Unkosi wangu lepi wa mulima uwu. Ngati kuvya unkosi wangu wa mulima wenuwu, vandu vevamlanda Yesu ngavanikengelili, vachilongosi va Vayawudi ngavanikamwili lepi. Nambu hinu unkosi wangu lepi wa penapa.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilatu akamjovela, “Hinu veve ndi Nkosi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu akayangula, “Veve ndi ujova kuvya nene ndi Nkosi. Ndava yeniyo nene nivelikiwi na nibweli pamulima kuvajovela vandu uchakaka. Mundu yeyoha wa uchaka akuniyuwanila.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilatu akamkota, “Uchakaka ndi chindu kiki?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu ihamuliwa lifwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matei 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maluko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilatu peamali kujova ago, akavahambila kavili vachilongosi va Chiyawudi kuvala, “Akavajovela nene nichiwene lepi chindu cheabudili. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Nambu ndi mvelu winu nene kuvadindulila, muchifungu mundu mmonga lukumbi lwa Pasaka. Hinu mwigana nivadindulila Nkosi wa Vayawudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Penapo vakayangula. “Mwe! Lepi mwenuyo mdindulila Balaba!” Balaba avi mundu mweinyaga vandu vindu.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Kangi, Pilatu akalagiza vamtola Yesu na kumtova michapilu. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Vala manjolinjoli vakabota njingwa ya minga, vakamuwalika kumutu, vakamuwalika nyula ya chinkosi langi ya zambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Vakavya kumbwelela palongolo yaki na kujova, “Tikuwoni, Nkosi wa Vayawudi!” Kuni vakumpamanda.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilatu akahuma kuvala kavili, akaujovela msambi wula, “Lola, nikumgotola mundu uyu kwinu, muhotola kumanya kuvya nene nichiwene lepi chindu chochoha cheabudili cha kumuhamula.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Hinu, Yesu, akahuma kuvala kuni awalili njingwa ya minga na nyula ya chinkosi. Pilatu akavajovela, “Mlola! Mundu mwene ndi uyu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Vakulu va kuteta na valonda pavamuwene vakayangula. “Mvambayi pamsalaba! Mvambayi pamsalaba!” Pilatu akavajovela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">“Mwavene mumtola hinu, mukamvamba muni nene nichiweni lepi chindu cheabudili.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Vayawudi vakamyangula, “Tavete tivii nagu Malagizu, na malagizu gitu gijova, yikumgana afwayi, ndava mwene ajidetekisi kuvya Mwana wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilatu peagayuwini malovi ago, akayogopa neju. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Kangi Pilatu akayingila munyumba ya unkosi, akamkota Yesu, “Veve uhumili koki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Nambu Yesu amyangwili lepi chindu. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilatu akamjovela, “Wu, wibela kulongela na nene? Wu, umanyi lepi kuvya nene nihotola kukudindulila na nihotola kulagiza uvambiwa pamsalaba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu akamyangula, “Ngauvi lepi na uhotola panani yangu changali kupewa na Chapanga. Ndava yeniyo yula mweaniletili kwaku ambudili neju.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kutumbula penapo, Pilatu alonda njila ya kumlekekesa Yesu, nambu Vayawudi vakaywanga. “Ngati umlekekisi mundu uyu, veve nkozi lepi wa nkosi wa ku Loma, mundu yoyoha mweajikita kuvya nkosi akumpinga nkosi mkulu wa Loma!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Hinu, Pilatu peayuwini malovi ago akamuhumisa Yesu kuvala, akatama pachigoda cha uhamula, pandu pepikemelewa “Luvanja lwelutengenizwi kwa maganga.” Amala kwa Chiebulania Gabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Yavi lukumbi lwa muhi, ligono la kutendelekela Pasaka. Pilatu akavajovela Vayawudi, “nkosi winu ndi uyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Vene vakaywanga, “Mkomayi! Mkomayi! Mvambayi pamsalaba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilatu akavakota, “Wu, nimvamba pamsalaba nkosi winu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Vakulu va kuteta vakayangula, “Tete tivii lepi na nkosi yungi nambu nga nkosi wa ku Loma!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Hinu, Pilatu akamgotola Yesu mumawoko gavi muni vamvambayi pamsalaba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu vakumvamba pamsalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matei 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Manjolinjoli, vakamtola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu akahuma kuni agegili msalaba waki, mbaka pandu pepikemelewa “Libangu la Mutu.” Kwa Chiebulania pikemelewa Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Penapo ndi pavamvambili pamsalaba, na pamonga nayu vavavambili pamisalaba yavi vandu vangi vavili mmonga upandi wa kulyela na yungi upandi wa kumangeya, Yesu ndi pagati yavi. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilatu akayandika likokoso pachibau akakivika panani ya msalaba, akayandika, “Yesu Mnazaleti Nkosi wa Vayawudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Hinu, Vayawudi vamahele vasomili likokoso ilo, muni pandu peavambiwi Yesu pamsalaba pavi papipi na muji. Kangi likokoso lenilo layandikwi kwa Chiebulania na Chilatini na Chigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Hinu, Vakulu va kuteta vakamjovela Pilatu, “Kotoka kuyandika. ‘Nkosi wa Vayawudi,’ Nambu mundu uyu ajovili kuvya, ‘Nene ndi Nkosi wa Vayawudi.’”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilatu akayangula, “Geniyandiki gala nimali, kuyandika!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Manjolinjoli pevamali kumvamba Yesu pamsalaba, vakazitola nyula zaki, vakavika malundu mcheche, kila mmonga na lilundu laki. Mewawa vakatola na lijoho laki la unkosi, lijoho ilo labotiwi kwa chipandi chimonga ndu, changali kutotewa. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Manjolinjoli vala, vakajovesana. “Tikotoka kuyipapula, muni titova kula yati livya la yani.” Lijambu lenili lahengiki muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gegijova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Vagavini nyula zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">Na nyula yangu vakayitovela kula.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ndi, chevahengili vala manjolinjoli.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Papipi na msalaba wa Yesu vayimili nyina waki Yesu, na mlumbu wa nyina waki na Maliya mdala wa Kileopa, na Maliya Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu peamuwene nyina waki, na papipi yaki ayimili muwuliwa yula mweamganili, akamjovela nyina waki. “Mau, Lola, mwenuyo ndi mwana waku.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Kangi akamjovela muwuliwa yula. “Lola, mwenuyo ndi nyina waku.” Na kutumbula lukumbi lula muwuliwa yula akamtola atama kunyumba yaki.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ifwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matei 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesu amanyili kuvya goha gamali kutimila, muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gatimilayi, akajova, “Niyuana njota.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Penapo pavi na nkele weumemili divayi yivavanu. Hinu vakajwiga litonji mudivayi yivavanu vakavika mulungoda lwa mkongo weukemiwa hisopo, vakamvikila pamlomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu peamali kupewa divayi yivavanu yila, akajova, “Goha gatimili!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Kangi akagundama mutu, akafwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumuhoma mgoha muluvafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Yavi ijumaa, ligono la kutendelekeha. Ndava muni, higa yikoto kutama pamsalaba Ligono la Kupumulila, muni ligono ilo lavi likulu kwa Vayawudi. Hinu vachilongosi va Vayawudi vakamuyupa Pilatu, magendelu ga vala vevavambiwi pamsalaba gadenyewayi na higa zavi ziwusiwayi. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Manjolinjoli vakahamba, vakayidenya magendelu ga mundu wa upandi wa kumangeya na yula wa upandi wa kulyela vevavambiwi pamisalaba pamonga na Yesu vala. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Nambu pavamhikili Yesu vamkoli amali kufwa, ndi vamdenyili lepi magendelu. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Nambu mmonga wavi amuhomili Yesu muluvafu na mgoha, bahapo yikahuma ngasi na manji. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Mwene yula mwealoli lijambu lenilo, alijovili muni na nyenye musadika. Na aga geajovili ndi uchakaka, kavili mwene imanya kuvya ijova chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Lijambu lenili lahengiki muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gatimila. “Kawaka hati lijege laki limonga lelidenyewa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Mewawa Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova. “Vakumlola yula mwevamuhomili.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumvika mulitinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matei 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Pagamaliki genago, Yosefu mkolonjinji wa Alimatei, akamuyupa Pilatu kuyihulusa higa ya Yesu kuhuma pamsalaba. Yosefu avi mulanda waki Yesu, nambu chamfiyu, muni ayogwipi vachilongosi wa Vayawudi. Ndi Pilatu akamyidakila, Yosefu ahambili kuyiwusa higa ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Yosefu alongosini na Nikodemu, mweamuhambili Yesu kimihi, akabwela agegili mahuta gegikemelewa manemane gegahangisini na ubani vibaba selasini. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Hinu voha vavili vakayitola higa ya Yesu, na kuyitindisila nyula ya msopi pamonga na mahuta ago ngati cheyavili mivelu ya Vayawudi pakuvika higa mulitinda. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Pandu pala pevamvambili Yesu pamsalaba, pavi na lidimba palidimba lenilo pavi na litinda la mupya lelavi lakona kumvika mundu yoyoha mugati yaki. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ndava ya mahengu ga Vayawudi ga kutendelekeha Ligono la Kupumulila, ndava litinda lenilo lavi papipi vakamuvika Yesu mwenumo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ayukili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matei 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Lukela hamba kucha Dominika, kwakona chitita, Maliya mkolonjinji wa Magidala akahamba kulitinda, na kulola liganga liwusiwi pamlyangu wa litinda. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Hinu, akajumba kuhamba kwa Simoni Petili na yula muwuliwa yungi, Yesu mwamganili, akavajovela, “Vamuwusili Bambu mulitinda, nakumanya kwevamvikili.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petili na muwuliwa yungi yula vakahamba kulitinda. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Voha vavili, vakajumba kuhamba, yungi yula ajumbili kanyata neju kuliku Petili, akalongolela kuhika kulitinda. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Peagundimi na kulingulila, ayiwene nyula ya msopi, nambu nakuyingila mugati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petili namwene, akabwela akumulanda akayingila mu litinda, mwenumo ayiwene nyula za msopi zila, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />chitambala chevamtindisili Yesu kumutu chila. Chitambala chenicho nakuvikwa pamonga na nyula ya msopi yeniyo, muni chagunyiwi na kuvikwa pandu pene. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Kangi muwuliwa yungi yula mwealongolili kuhika kulitinda, akayingila mugati akalola na kusadika. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Vavi vakona kumanya, Mayandiku Gamsopi gegijova Yamganili kuyuka. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Hinu, Vawuliwa vala vakawuya kunyumba.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhumila Maliya wa Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matei 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maluko 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maliya ayimili kuvala ya litinda, kuni ivemba. Na peayendalili kuvemba, avi mukugundama na kulingulila mu litinda, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />avawene Vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga vavili vevawalili nyula za msopi vatamili pala peyavili higa ya Yesu mmonga kumutu na yungi kumagendelu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Vamitumu vala vakamkota, “Mau, ndava kyani wivemba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">“Maliya akavajovela, vamtoli Bambu wangu nakumanya kwevamvikili!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Maliya peamalili kujova genago, ang'anamwiki mumbele, amuwene Yesu ayimili penapo, nambu amanyili lepi kuvya ndi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu akamkota, “Mau, ndava kyani uvemba? Ukumlonda yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Maliya, akahololela kuvya mwenuyo myimilila lidimba, akamjovela, “Mtopeswa, ngati veve umtolili nijovela kweumvikili, na nene yati nikumtola.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu akamjovela, “Maliya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Mwene Maliya akang'anamuka, akamjovela kwa Chiebulania, “Laboni.” Mana yaki “Muwula.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu akamjovela, “Kotoka kunikamula, nakona kuhamba kunani kwa Dadi. Nambu hamba kwa valongo vangu uvajovela, nihamba kunani kwa Dadi wangu na Dadi winu, Chapanga wangu na Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Maliya wa Magidala, akahamba kuvajovela mambu gala vawuliwa, kuvya amuwene Bambu, ndi amjovili genago.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vawuliwa vaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matei 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Yavili kimihi ya ligono lenilo la Dominika. Vawuliwa vakonganiki pamonga mugati ya nyumba, kuni milyangu yavi yidindiwi, ndava ya kuvayogopa vachilongosi va Vayawudi. Yesu akabwela, akayima pagati yavi, akavajovela, “Uteke uvya na nyenye!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Peamali kujova genago, akavalangisa mawoko gaki na luvafu lwaki. Ndi vawuliwa venavo vakasangaluka neju kumlola Bambu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu akavajovela kavili, “Uteke uvya na nyenye! Ngati Dadi cheanitumili nene, na nene nikuvatuma nyenye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Peamali kujova genago, akavapulila na kuvajovela, “Mpokela Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Vandu vemukuvalekekesa kumbudila Chapanga kwavi, yati vilekekeswa, na vandu mwavangalekekesa, yati vilekekeswa lepi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi mmonga wa vawuliwa kumi na vavili vala, mweikemiwa mapaha, avi lepi pamonga nawu lukumbi Yesu peabweli. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Vawuliwa vangi vala, vakamjovela, “Timuwene Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Tomasi akavajovela, “Ngati nakugawona mavamba ga misumali mu mawoko gaki na kuvika lukonji lwangu mu mavamba ago na kuvika chiwoko changu muluvafu lwaki, yati nisadika lepi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Magono nane gegagelekili, vawuliwa vavi pamonga mugati mula, na Tomasi namwene avi. Milyangu yavi hidindiwi, nambu Yesu akabwela, akayima pagati yavi, akajova, “Uteke uvya na nyenye!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Kangi akamjovela Tomasi, “Vika lukonji lwaku ulola mawoko gangu, leta chiwoko chaku mu luvafu lwangu. Leka mtahu, nambu usadikayi!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi akamyangula, “Bambu wangu na Chapanga wangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu akavajovela, “Ndava uniwene nene ndi usadiki, vamotisiwa vala vanganiwona nambu vanisadiki.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chechikitili chitabu ichi chiyandikwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu akitili gachinamtiti gangi gamahele, palongolo ya vawuliwa vaki, nambu gayandikwi lepi muchitabu ichi. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Nambu zenizi zeziyandikwi, muni mpata kusadika kuvya Yesu ndi Kilisitu Msangula, Mwana wa Chapanga, ndava ya kusadika mpata na wumi kwa liina laki.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vawuliwa saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Pagamaliki genago, Yesu akavahumila kavili vawuliwa vaki pamuhana ya nyanja Tibelia. Avahumili naha, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petili, Tomasi mweikemewa Mapaha, na Natanyeli mkolonjinji wa Kana ya ku Galilaya, vana vavili va Zebedayo na vawuliwa vaki vangi vavili, vakavya voha pamonga. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petili akavajovela, “Nihamba kulova somba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Vene vakamjovela, “Tete tilongosana na veve.” Vakahamba, vakakwela muwatu, nambu kilu yila nakupata chindu. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Hamba kucha, Yesu ayimili kumwambu ya nyanja, nambu vawuliwa vamanyili lepi kuvya avi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesu akavakota, “Vankozi, mupatili lepi somba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Vakamyangula, “Lepi! Kawaka.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu akavajovela, “Muhelesa ngwanda upandi wa kulyela wa watu na nyenye yati mwipata somba.” Ndi vakazihelesa ngwanda, nambu hinu nakuhotola kuhuta kavili ndava ya somba zamahele.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Kangi muwuliwa yula, Yesu mweamganili neju, akamjovela Petili, “Ndi Bambu!” Simoni Petili peayuwini kuvya ndi Bambu, akajikunga nyula yaki ya kuvala muni ahulili, akajitaga mumanji. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Nambu vawuliwa vangi vala vabwelili kumbwani na watu kuni vihuta ngwanda zezimemili somba, vavi lepi kutali na pandumba, ndi vavi utali wa mita miya yimonga kuhuma mu mkingisa. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Pavahikili pandumba wauwene motu wa makalakala, wiyaka, na panani yaki pavikiwi somba na libumunda. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu akavajovela, “Mgava somba zingi mleta penapa zemlovili.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Petili akayingila muwatu, akahuta mbaka kundumba ngwanda yila yeyimemili somba zivaha miya yimonga na makumi mhanu na zidatu. Pamonga wamemili somba zamahele, nambu ngwanda yadawiki lepi. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu akavajovela “Mbwela mlawuka.” Kawaka hati mmonga wavi. Mwealingili kumkota. “Veve ndi wayani,” Vammanyili kuvya Bambu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu akabwela, akatola, libumunda akavapela, akakita mewawa na somba zila.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Yeniyi yavi mala ya datu Yesu kuvahumila vawuliwa vaki peamali kuyuka.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Pevamali kulya, Yesu akamkota Simoni Petili, “Simoni mwana wa Yohani! Wu, ukunigana nene kuliku ava?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Mwene akayangula, “Ena, Bambu, umanyili kuvya nene nikukugana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu akamjovela, “Dima vana mambelele vangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Kavili akamjovela, “Simoni mwana wa Yohani! Wu, ukunigana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Petili akamyangula, “Ena, Bambu, umanyili kuvya nikukugana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu akamjovela “Dima mambelele gangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesu akamkota mala ya datu, “Simoni mwana wa Yohani! Wu, ukunigana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Penapo Petili akavya ngolongondi ndava amkotili mala ya datu. “Ukunigana?” Akamjovela, “Bambu, wamwene umanyili kila chindu, umanyili kuvya nene nikukugana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu akamjovela, “Dima mambelele gangu! <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Chakaka nikukujovela, pawavi msongolo wayovalili kujitendelekeha wamwene na kuhamba kwewigana. Nambu pawivya mgogolo wiyinula mawoko gaku, mundu yungi ndi yati akukunga na kuhamba kwe wangagana kuhamba.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu ajovili genago, kulangisa namuna Petili cheifwa na kumpela ukulu Chapanga. Kangi akamjovela Petili, “Nilanda.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na muwuliwa yungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petili akang'anamuka, amuwene muwuliwa yula mweaganiwi na Yesu, akumlanda mweneuyo ndi yula mweatamili papipi neju na Yesu lukumbi pevalyayi na kumkota, “Bambu ndi yani mweakukung'anamukila?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Hinu, Petili peamuwene mwenuyo, akamkota Yesu, “Bambu, mundu uyu chikumuhumila kyani?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu akayangula, “Ngati nigana asigalila mbaka penibwela, chikuvala kyani? Veve unilanda nene.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Malovi ago, gadandasiki pagati ya valongo vevakumsadika Kilisitu kuvya muwuliwa mwenuyo yati ifwa lepi. Nambu Yesu amjovili lepi muwuliwa yula ifwa lepi, nambu ajovili, “Ngati nigana asigalila mbaka panibwela yikukuvala kyani?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Mwenuyu ndi muwuliwa, mwealoli mambu ago na kugayandika. Tete timanyili ajovili chakaka.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nimalakisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Gavi mambu gangi gamahele geagahengili Yesu. Ngati goha ngagiyandikwayi, niholela hati mulima woha nakuvya pandu pa kuvika hitabu yeyiyandikwi. Ena.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>